<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1KI" style="id">Kumpite Khatna</book>
  <para style="h">Kumpite Khatna</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kumpite Khatna</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kumpite Khatna</para>
  <para style="mt">Kumpite Khatna</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpipa David sia tu in pasal huai mama khat hi a, a naseamte in puanvante thuapin silhsak hikale a khualum thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ahikom a uliante in ama munah, “Kumpipa awng, nang taw om in hong ou tu numei khangmoi khat hong zonsak tu khu hi. Ama in nangma kungah lum tu a, na khua hong lumsak tu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel ngam bup ah ngaknu mealpha khat kizong a, tuabang a mealpha Abishag a kici khat Shunem ah mu a, kumpipa kungah kipaipui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama sia a mealpha mama a, kumpipa zongh ou hi, ahihang ama in nupa vai a nei pui bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tu in Absalom a thi tak ciang David ii Haggith taw a tapa Adonijah sia a nungta lai te sung pan a tapa lianbel ahi hi. Ama sia a mealhoi mama mihing khat ahi hi. David in ama sia bangma hunin teih ngeingawl a, tuaciang ama zongh kumpipa suak nuam mama hi. Ama atu in siphu ngalleangte, siphu te le ama a cing mihing 50 koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in Joab (A nu Zeruiah) le thiampi Abiathar taw thu kikum uh hi, tuaciang amate in ama panpui tu in lungkim uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahihang thiampi Zadok, Jehoiada ii tapa Benaiah, kamsaangpa Nathan, Shimei, Rei le David a cing te sia Adonijah sangah a pang bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ni khat ni in Adonijah in Enrogel cik hui Ngul Suangpi a kicina munah tuute, khuitalte, khuino thaute taw sangaw biakpiakna khat nei hi. Ama in David kumpipa ii tapa dangte le Judah pan kumpipa ii uliante tua sangaw biakpiakna anneakpoai sungah sam hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />ahihang ama in a suapui sealh Solomon, kamsaangpa Nathan, Benaiah le kumpipa a cingpa sam ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Nathan in Solomon ii nu Bathsheba kungah pai in ama munah, “Haggith ii tapa Adonijah in ama le ama kumpipa a kisuasak hunlam za ngawl ni ziam? Tuaciang Kumpipa David in hi thu bangma he ngawl hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nangma le na tapa Solomon ii nuntakna na hu nuam le, ngaisutna hong pia khi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tu mama in Kumpipa David kungah pai in a, ‘Kumpipa awng, ciliap huai takin kei tungah kamciam nong piakna ah ka tapa Solomon in na kumpi za hong laih tu ci ka na ngawl ni ziam? Tua ahile Adonijah sia bangbangin kumpi suak thei ziam?’ ci in va dongh ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaciang Nathan in, “Tuasia ciang Kumpipa David taw na papau laitakin kei kong tum tu a, na thuson teng maan hi kong ci tu hi,” ci lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahikom Bathsheba in kumpipa lupna inndoi sungah ama taw kimu tu in pai hi. Ama huai mama zo a, Shunem panin Abishag in ou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bathsheba sia kumpipa mai ah a niamin hong kun a, tuaciang ama in, “Bang uuk ni ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in, “Kumpipa awng, Topa na Pathian ii min taw kei tungah ciliap huai takin kamciam nong piakna ah, nang zawkciang kumpi a suak tu sia ka tapa Solomon hi tu hi ci ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahihang Adonijah sia kumpipa suak zo a, tuaciang hi thu huvau nang bangma he ngawl ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in khuital tam ma, tuute, khuino thaute sangaw biakpiakna in pia a, ama in biakpiakna poai ah na tapate, thiampipa Abiathar, na ngalkaphonpi ukpa Joab sam hi, ahihang ama in na tapa Solomon sam ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kumpipa awng, Israel mite theampo in na kumpi za hong laih tu sia na son tu hong ngak tek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuabang na hi buale na thi pawpo ciang ka tapa Solomon le kei sia thumaan ngawlte a vawt bangin hong kivawt tu hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bathsheba a papau laitakin, kumpipa inn sungah Nathan tum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nathan a om hunlam kumpipa tungah kison a, kamsaangpa Nathan sungtangin kumpipa mai ah kun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama in, “Kumpipa awng, Adonijah sia nang hong laih tu kumpipa ci in taangko zo ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tu ni mama in ama pai a, khuital tam ma, tuu le khuino thaute sangaw biakpiakna in pia hi. Ama in na tapate theampo, na ngalkaphonpi ukpa Joab, tuaciang thiampipa Abiathar te sam a, tu in amate poai khaam in, ‘Kumpipa Adonijah a khansau tahen!” ci in au uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahihang ama in kei hong sam ngawl hi, topa awng, thiampipa Zadok ahizong, Benaiah ahizong, Solomon ahizong sam ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hiteng sia kumpipa ii na thukim ma ziam, nang hong laih tu sia na uliante ngawngawn zongh na son ngawl ma ahi ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kumpipa David in, “Bathsheba hong tumsak kik tavun,” a ci ciang ama hong pai a, ama mai ah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuaciang ama munah, “Ka ngim nga na theampo pan hong suatakpa, a nungta Topa min taw nang tungah kamciam hong pia khi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />tu ni in Topa Israel te ii Pathian min taw kamciam kong piak sia kholet tu khi hi, na tapa Solomon in keima kumpi za hong laih tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Bathsheba kunsuk in, “Ka topa kumpipa nungta tawntung tahen!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua zawkciang David kumpipa in Zadok, Nathan le Benaiah samsak hi. Amate hong pai ciangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />ama in, “Ka zum uliante keng vun a; ka tapa Solomon sia ka laa tungah tosak in, Gihon cik ah tha suk tavun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />tua munah Zadok le Nathan in Israel kumpipa tu in sathau noai tahen. Tua zawkciang lemle tum vun a, ‘Solomon kumpipa a khansau tahen!’ ci in au vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ka kumpi tokhum tungah to tu in hi munah hong heak kik ciangin, a nung zui vun. Ama in ka kumpi za hong laih tu hi banghang ziam cile ama sia Israel le Judah uk tu in ka tealsa ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Benaiah in, “Na dei bangin ka seam tu hi, tuaciangin Topa in hong kipsak tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Topa in nang kumpipa hong ompui bangin Solomon taw zong hong omkhawm tahen, tuaciang ama ii kumpi maanna zongh nang sangin mainawt zaw lai tahen,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tua ahikom Zadok, Nathan, Benaiah le kumpipa a cingte in Solomon sia Kumpipa David ii laa tungah suan in, Gihon cik ah tha uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Zadok in Topa ompuina puanbuk pan a paipui olive thau bung la in, Solomon sathau noai hi. Amate in lemle tum a, mipite theampo au in, “Kumpipa Solomon a khansau tahen!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tua zawkciang amate theampo in ama nungzui kik a, lungdam in a auna le tamngai a tumna hu in, lei liing khop dongin a aw uh nging hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Adonijah le a leangnate theampo a poai a man kuan ciang, tua awnging za uh hi. Tuaciang Joab in lemle aw a zaak ciang, “Khuapi sungah awnging sia bang khiakna nei ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />A pau a man ma in thiampi Abiathar ii tapa Jonathan hong theng hi. Adonijah in, “Hong pai ta'n, nang pasal pha khat ni hi, thupha khat hong puak hi nanak tu ni hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Jonathan in, “Thupha hong puak ngawl khi hi,” ci in zo hi. “Kumpi ahi David kumpipa in Solomon sia kumpipa suaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ama in Zadok, Nathan, Benaiah le kumpipa cingte in thasak hi. Amate in kumpipa laa tungah Solomon tosak uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />tuaciang Zadok le Nathan in Gihon cik ah sathau noai in kumpi suaksak hi. Tua zawkciang amate lungdamna taw au kawmin khuapi sungah tum uh a, tuasia ciang tu in mipite ngamlum lialua uh hi. Tuasia, tu a na zaak uh awnging sia ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Solomon sia tu in kumpipa suak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tua teng bek dom ngawlin kumpipa ii uliante pai a, Kumpipa David zatakna pia in, ‘Na Pathian in Solomon sia nang sang zongh in minthangsak zaw lai tahen, tuaciang Solomon kumpi maanna sia nang aa sangin nopci zaw lai tahen,’ ci uh hi. Tua zawkciang Kumpipa David in a lupna tungah kun in biakpiakna vawt a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />tuaciang in thungen hi, ‘Ka suan ka paalte khat tuni in kei hong laih in kumpi a suasak sia a mu tu in hong nungtasak Israel ii Pathian Topa pok tek tawng,’ ” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Adonijah ii leangnate lau in, a vekpi ding a, amate a sansak tek ah pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Adonijah in Solomon kiita mama ahikom Topa ii ompuina puanbuk sungah pai a, biaknatau kiil lenin om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Adonijah in ama kiita ahikom biaknatau king lenin om a, ama in, “A masa phitbel in Kumpi Solomon in kei hong thalup ngawl natu kamciam hong pia le dei khi hi,” a ci teng Solomon tungah kison hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Solomon in, “Ama kei tungah hong thumaan po le a luzang samzam khat zongh kithutha ngawl tu hi; ahihang hong thumaan bua ahile thi tu hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Tua zawkciang, Solomon kumpipa in Adonijah sia biaknatau panin samsak hi. Adonijah hong pai in kumpipa ii mai ah kun suk a, tuaciang kumpipa in ama munah, “Nang cia thei ni hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David in a thi tu nai ciang a tapa Solomon sam a, a khakbel hilna teng son hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ka thi tu hun hong theng zo hi. Kimuang in a, takkha in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tuaciang Topa na Pathian ii vawt a hong sawl teng vawt in. A thukhamte le a thupiakna te a vekpi in Moses ii thukham sungah a ki at babang zui in, tua hile na paina po, na sepna pawpo ah na nuamsa thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama thu na ni le, Topa ii kei tungah hong piak ka suan ka paalte in thumaan tak le thintak lungtak taw ama ii thupiakte a nit tu a kidop uh laiteng in, Israel ngam uk tu hi ci in kamciam sia ama in kholet tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Thudang khat om lai hi. Joab in kei tungah hong ngamtatna ciamtee tu ni hi, ama in Israel te ngalkaphonpite a uk, Ner ii tapa Abner le Jether ii tapa Amasa te nii hong thalupsak hi. Ngal sungah thina hangin ngal kilem hun sungah phulam in tualthat ahi sia na phawk tu hi. Ama in mihing mawnei ngawlte that ahikom tu in ama ngamtatna teng keima pu khi hi, tuasia taw kizui in a piang babang thuak khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na vawt tu bangziam ci in he ni hi; ama sia thi ngei bang thawthongin thisak ngawl tu ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Ahihang Gilead pan Barzillai tapate tungah hesuakna lak ta'n a, a pha takin ou ta'n, banghang ziam cile na suapuipa Absalom kung pan ka tai lai in amate in kei hong hesuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Benjamin ngam Bahurim khua panin Gera ii tapa Shimei a ci khat zongh om hi. Mahanaim ka zot lai in nasia takin hong haamsiat hi, ahihang Jordan ngun ah ka kisik ciangin ama a kithalup ngawl natu in Topa min taw a ciliap huai kamciam ka pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahihang ama daan piak ngawlin thaa thong ngawl het tu ni hi. Bang vawt tu ci in nangma he ni hi, ama a kithisak natu na vaihawm kul tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />David thi a David khuapi ah kiphum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in kum 40 sung Israel kumpi seam a, Hebron ah kum sali, Jerusalem ah kum 33 sung maang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Solomon in a pa David ii kumpi za lua a, ama ii kumpi vaangletna kip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Haggith ii tapa, Adonijah sia Solomon ii nu Bathsheba kungah haw hi. “Kilem vai in hong vak na hi ziam?” ci in Bathsheba in dongh hi. Adonijah in, “Hi hi,” ci in zo hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tuaciang, “Kong nget nop khat om hi,” ci lai hi. Ama in, “Tua sia bang ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in, “Na heaksa bangin kei sia kumpi ka sua natu hi, Israel ngam ah mi theampo in tuabangin muangmaw hi. Ahihang a tuam dang khat in hong piang a, ka suapuipa sia kumpipa suak hi, banghang ziam cile tuasia Topa deina hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tu in nget nop khat hong nei khi hi; nong hesuakna in hong nial heak in,” ci in zo hi. Bathsheba in, “A bang ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in, “Nong hesuakna in Kumpipa Solomon tungah Shunem panin numei Abishag sia ka zi tu in hong ngetsak ta'n — nang sia ama in hong nial ngawl tu ci in he khi hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua nu in, “Pha mama hi nang atu Kumpipa tungah kong sonsak tu hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ahikom Bathsheba sia kumpipa kungah Adonijah taangin a paupui tu in pai hi. Kumpipa sia a nu muak tu in dingto a, a nu kun hi. Tuasia zawkciang ama kumpi tokhum tungah to a, a nu atu tokhum dang khat lasak in a ziatsang ah tosak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in, “Hamphatna no khat hong ngen nuam khi hi; nong hesuakna in hong nial heak in,” ci hi; Ama in, “Bang ziam nu awng?Hong nial bong,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A nu in, “Na suapuipa Adonijah ii zi tu in Abishag pia in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kumpipa in, “Banghangin ama piak tu in Abishag hong ngen ni ziam?” ci in dongh hi. “Kumpi tokhum zongh ngetsak vet in. Adonijah sia ka u ahikom, thiampi Abiathar le Joab zongh ama ii sangah pang hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Solomon in Topa min taw kiciam a, “Adonijah in hi bang hong nget hu in ama nuntakna taw ka lulsak bua ngawngaw le Pathian in kei hong vualum tahen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Topa in ka pa David ii kumpi tokhum tungah kip takin kei hong koi zo hi; ama in a kamciam kholet in kumpi ngam sia ka suan ka paalte dongin hong pia zo hi. Adonijah sia tu ni mama in thi tu hi ci in a nungta Topa taw kiciam khi hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ahikom Solomon kumpipa in Benaiah thupia a, tua pa va pai in Adonijah that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Kumpipa Solomon in Abiathar thiampipa tungah, “Na teenna ngam Anathoth ah cia ta'n. A thi tu kilawm ni hi, ahizong ka pa David taw na om lai in Topa Thuciamna Thingkuang a keam pa na hi hu le ama ii ngim ngana theampo a thuakpui pa zongh na hi hu in, tu in hong thisak ngawl tu khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Solomon in thiampi Abiathar sia Topa ii thiampi a sepna pan tawpsak hi, tuabangin Topa ii Shiloh ah thiampi Eli le a suan a paalte huvau a pauna taangtungsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Joab in thupiang teng za hi. (Ama in Absalom panpui ngawl ahihang Adonijah panpui hi.) Tua ahikom ama tai in Topa ii ompuina puanbuk sungah biaknatau ii kingte lenin om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kumpipa Solomon in Joab sia puanbuk bealh tu in tai a, biaknatau hui ah a om hunlam a zaak ciang, Kumpipa Solomon in kamtai khat sawlin Joab munah banghangin biaknatau a bealh tu in tai ni ziam ci in donghsak hi. Joab in Topa kungah ka tai sia Solomon ka kiitak hang hi ci in zo hi. Tua ahikom Kumpipa Solomon in Joab a that tu in Benaiah paisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ama Topa ii ompuina Puanbuk ah pai in Joab munah, “Kumpipa in pusuak a hong sawl hi,” ci hi. Joab in, “Hong pusuak ngawl tu khi hi. Hi sungah thi zaw tu khi hi,” ci in zo hi. Benaiah heak kikin kumpipa munah Joab pauna teng son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Joab ii ci bangin vawt in. Ama that in a, phum in. Tuasia ciangin kei ka hi zong, David ii suan le paal dangte ahizong Joab ii mawnei ngawl a thalupte huvau ah vaipuak ka nei nawn buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ka pa David ii heak ngawl laanin, mihing a thana hu in Topa in Joab daan pia tu hi. Joab in ama sangin mi pha ahizaw, a maw ngawl mihing nii thatlum a: Israel te ngalkaphonpi ukpa Abner le Judah te ngalkaphonpi ukpa Amasa te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Amate ii mihing thanate hu in daan piakna sia Joab le a suan a paalte tungah a tawntungin tung tu hi. Ahihang Topa in David suan le paal te ama ii kumpi tokhum tungah a to peuma zawna pia tawntung tu hi,” Solomon in ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua ahikom Benaiah in Topa ompuina Puanbuk ah pai in Joab that hi, tuaciang ama sia ama ii inn, ngam taanzauna ah kiphum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Kumpipa in Benaiah sia Joab taangin ngalkaphonpi ukpa suaksak a, thiampipa Zadok in Abiathar za laihsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua zawkciang kumpipa in Shimei samsak a, “Hi sung Jerusalem ah nangma atu in inn khat sa in. A sungah teang in a, khuapi nusia heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Inn nusia in Kidron lui na kaantan le thi tatak tu ni hi — tuaciang nangma mawna hi tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Shimei in, “Pha mama hi, Kumpipa awng, na ci babangin ngamta tu khi hi,” ci in zo kik hi. Tuabangin ama Jerusalem ah ngei ma teang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ahizong kum thum zawkciang, Shimei ii silate nii sia, Maacah ii tapa Achish, Gath kumpipa tuu in tai uh hi. Shimei in amate sia Gath ah om hi ci in a zaak ciangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />a laa tung to in Gath khua Achish kumpipa kungah pai a tua silate zong hi. Amate mu in inn ah hong cia pui kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Solomon in Shimei ngamtatna teng a zaak ciangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />ama samsak a, “Jerusalem na nusiat ngawl natu in Topa min taw kamciam kong piasak hi. Tuaciang na nusia napo le thi tatak tu ni hi ci in na kidop natu thu kong piaksa hi. Tuabang thukim in na thu kong ni tu hi nong cisa hi ngawl ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tua ahile banghangin ciampeal in kong thupiakna hong mang ngawl ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ka pa David tungah na tatkhialnate theampo he nginge ni hi. Topa in nang tua hu in daan hong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ahihang ama in kei thupha hong pia tu a, David ii kumpi ngam sia ngammuangsak tawntung tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tua zawkciang kumpipa thupiak bangin Benaiah pusuak a, Shimei that hi. Tu in Solomon in uk siat hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Solomon in Egypt kumpipa tanu a teenpuina taw ngal vai a kipawlna khat nei hi. Ama in tua nu sia a kumpi inn, Biakinnpi le Jerusalem khua uumna luphungte a sak man dong David khuapi ah a teang tu in ciapui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa atu in biakinn kisa ngawl lai hi, tua ahikom mipite in sangaw biakpiaknate mun tuatuam ah vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Solomon in Topa it a, a pa David ii hil bangin ngamta hi, ahihang ama in ngannote ngo a, biaknatau tuatuamte ah sangaw biakpiaknate zongh nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khatvei, ama sia Gibeon ah sangaw biakpiakna vawt tu in pai hi, banghang ziam cile tua munah biaknatau a minthangbel sia om hi. Ama in hun bosa sungah tua munah meihal biakpiaknate a za simin pia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua zanin Topa sia a mang sungah hong kilaak a, “Bang kong piak tu na uukbel ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Solomon in, “Nangma in ka pa David, na naseampa sia itna lianpi na lak tawntung hi, tuaciang ama pha a, thutakin nang taw a kizopna sungah thumaan hi. Tuaciangin ama panmun ah tu ni in ngam a uk nangma in a kizom paisuakin tapa khat na piakna taw a lian na itna kip na lak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Oh Topa Pathian, keima sia ka khanmoi mama in ngam ukzia he ngawl ka hihang, nangma in ka pa ii kumpi za nong laihsak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hi sungah nangma atu na tealsa mite tam leihin a kisim zo ngawlte sungah om khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahikom na mite thutang khenna taw ka uk thei natu le a pha le a sia ka khentel thei natu in ciimna hong pia ta'n. Tua ahibuale bangbangin hi na mihonpite uk thei tu khi ziam?” ci hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Solomon ii hisia a nget sia Topa lungkim hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tua ahikom ama munah, “Nangma atu in khansauna ahizong, hau natu ahibuale na ngalte thi natu ahizong, hong ngen ngawlin thutang takin uk thei natu ciimna hong ngenzaw na hikom,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />nong nget bangin kong pia tu hi. Ciimna le tel theina sia tu masia le maisang zong kuama peuma ii a tamzaw in a nei ngeingawl tu za kong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nong nget ngawlte zongh hong pia si tu khi hi: na khan tawntung hauna le minphatna zongh kumpipa dang khat pawpo sangin tamzaw nga tu ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaciang na pa David bangin kei thu nong ni a ka thukhamte le ka thupiakte na keamcing le khansauna hong pia tu khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Solomon khanglo a, Pathian in a mang sungah a paupui hunlam phawk hi. Tua zawkciang ama Jerusalem ah pai in Thuciamna Thingkuang mai ah dingin Topa tungah meihal biakpiakna le kipawlkhop biakpiakna vawt hi. Tua zawkciangin a uliante theampo atu anneak poai khat vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ni khat ni in pumpi kizuak numei nii hong pai a, Kumpipa Solomon mai ah amate ii thu teng son uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khat sia in, “Kumpipa awng, hi numei le keima sia inn khat sungah teang khawm khu hi, tuaciang keima in ama om sung ma in inn ah nausen pano khat ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka nau a sua zawk ni nii ciang ama zongh in nau pano khat nei hi. Koma nii bekma tua inn sungah teang a — kuama dang om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua zawk zan khat ciangin ama in a nau tungah kilumliik tha in, a nau dellum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama zan lai in tho a, ka mut lanin ka tapa sia ka pangh pan hong la a, ama ii lupna ah paipui hi; tua zawkciang ama in nausen thisa sia keima ii lupna ah koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A zing ciang zingsang ka khanlaw ciangin ka nau noai pia tu ka hile a thisa ahi sia ka mu hi. Nausen pha takin ka etcian ciang ka ta ahi ngawl sia ka mu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahihang nupi dang khat sia in, “Hi ngawl hi! Nau thisa sia nang aa hi a, a nungta sia kei aa hi!” ci hi. Nupi a pau masa sia in, “Hi ngawl hi! Nau a thi sia nang aa hi a, a nungta sia keima aa hi!” ci kik hi. Tuabangin kumpipa mai ah kinial uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Kumpipa Solomon in, “Na nii uh ma in, nau a nungta sia kei aa hi ci in a thisa sia ahile ama aa hi ci nu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in namsau khat lasak a, hong thet ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />ama in, “Nau a nungta sia phalbat in a, nupite a lang veve hawmsak in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A nu tatak sia in a tapa a itna taw kidim ahikom kumpipa munah, “Kumpipa awng, nong hesuakna in nau sia that heak in! Ama pia in!” ci hi. Ahihang nupi dang khat sia in, “Koma khat zongh hong pia heak in; khen nii ma hong suasak po ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Solomon in, “Nau sia that heak in! Nupi a pau masa sia pia in — ama sia a nu tatak hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Israel mipite in Solomon ii thu khenna a zaak uh ciang ama ii tungah zatakna nasia tak nei uh hi, banghang ziam cile tuasia tak ciang ama sia thu kituu te tang takin a khen thei natu Pathian in ciimna pia hi, ci in he uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Solomon sia Israel ngam bup ii kumpipa hi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tuaciang hite sia a uliante ahi uh hi: Thiampi: Zadok ii tapa Azariah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zum thuzeakpite: Shisha tapate Elihoreph le Ahijah Thu ciamtee pipa: Ahilud tapa Jehoshaphat
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngalkaphonpi ukpa: Jehoiada tapa Benaiah Thiampite: Zadok le Abiathar
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngamkhen uk mangte a ukpipa: Nathan tapa Azariah Kumpi thudokpa: Nathan tapa thiampi Zabud
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kumpi inn sung naseamte a ukpa: Ahishar Zawthawk thu taw na a kiseam sakte a ukpa: Abda ii tapa Adoniram ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Solomon in Israel ngam sungah ngamkhen uk mangte sawm le nii koi hi. Kumpipa le a bangkua ii kum khat bup a neak tu sia tua mangte khat simin a uk sung ngamkhen tek panin tha sim a banin piasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ulian sawm le niite le amate ii ukna ngamkhente sia hi bang ahi hi: Benhur: Ephraim mualtung ngam teng
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bendeker: Makaz, Shaalbim, Beth Shemesh, Elon le Beth Hanan khuapite
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Benhesed: Arubboth le Socoh khuapite le Hepher ngam theampo
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Solomon tanu Taphath ii pasal Benabinadab: Dor ngamkhen buppi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahilud tapa Baana: Taanach le Megiddo khuapite le Jezreel khua thangsang, Beth Shan le Zarethan nai khuate ah a om ngamkhen theampo, Abel Meholah khuapi le Jokmeam khuapi dong
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bengeber: Gilead ngam Ramoth khuapi, tuaciang Manasseh ii suan ahi Jair ii bee le phung neisa Gilead ah khuanote le Bashan ngamsung Argob ngamkhen, a vekpi in khua lian sawmluk hi a, luphung taw a ki uum le kongpite taau taw a kikalh te
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Iddo tapa Ahinadab: Mahanaim ngamkhen
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Solomon ii tanu dang khat Basemath ii pasal Ahimaaz: Naphtali ngam
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hushai tapa Baana: Asher ngamkhen le Bealoth khua
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Paruah tapa Jehoshaphat: Issachar ngam
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ela tapa Shimei: Benjamin ngam
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Uri tapa Geber: Amor kumpipa Sihon le Bashan kumpipa Og ii a ukna sa Gilead ngamkhen Hi ngam uk sawm le niite ii tungsia ah ngam bup a uk mang khat om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Judah le Israel mite sia tuipivaal a senmal za in tam hi; amate in ne in, dawnin, lungdam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Solomon ii kumpi ngam sia Euphrates ngun pan Philistia le Egypt te ngamngi dong ngam theampo kihel hi. Amate in shia pia in, ama nuntak sung tawntung a khutnuai ah om uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Solomon ii ni sim a tulmawk ante sia, zungtaang vui neal litre 5,000, an litre 10,000,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />sangai, saza, sanang le akte bek dom ngawlin, inn ah a kivaak khui sawm, ngam sungah a kitha khui kul le tuu zakhat te ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Solomon in Euphrates Ngun ii nitumna sang ngam theampo, Tiphsah khua omna Euphrates pan nitumna sang Gaza khuapi dong uk hi. Tuaciang Euphrates ii nitumna sang kumpipate theampo sia ama khutnuai hi a, ngamngi kizawng ngamte theampo taw kilem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama nuntak lai tengin Judah le Israel ngamsung a teang mite ngammuangin, innkuan simin a sapitkungte le a thei kungte taw nuamsa uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Solomon in ngalleang kai siphute atu siphu buk 40,000 le siphu ngalkap 12,000 nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ngamuk mang sawm le niite in Solomon le a kumpi inn sungah an ne theampo atu an sia tha simin a piak tu za tek pia uh hi; amate in a kisamh theampo a tawntungin pia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ngamkhen uk mang khat simin a kisamh babang taangpi le taangphawte zongh, ngalsimna siphute le naseam nganhingte an tu sik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pathian in Solomon sia a tuampian ciimna le thuthuk mu theina, a kitee thei ngawl heakna lianpi pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Solomon sia Nisuana sang a miciimte ahibuale Egypt miciimte sangin ciim zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama sia mihing a minpiang a ciimbel ahi hi: Ezrah mi Ethan, tuaciang, Mahol ii tate ahi Heman, Calcol le Darda, sangin ciimzaw a, ama ii minthanna sia kiim le paam ngam theampo dongin kizel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ama in paunak 3,000 le la ngui tul vaal phuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ama in thingkung le lopate thu thusonin nei a, Lebanon a cedar te pan pang tung a po hyssop te thu dong son thei hi; ama in ngamsate, vacimte, awmtaal nganhingte le ngasate ii thu son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Leitung bup a kumpite in a ciimna za a, a thuson ngai tu in thataak mite paisak uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tyre kumpipa Hiram sia David ii lawm khat hi tawntung a, tuaciang Solomon in a pa David ii kumpiza laih zo hi ci in a zaak ciang tongciinte ama kungah paisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Solomon in Hiram tungah hi kamte thaak kik hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Na heak bangma ka pa David in a kiim a om ngam theampo taw ngal kisim tawntung ahi hu in Topa in a ngalte theampo tungah zawna a piak mateng ama in Topa a Pathian a biak natu biakinn a sa thei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahihang tu in Topa ka Pathian in ka ngamngi dung theampo ah kilemna hong pia zo hi. Ngal nei nawn ngawl khi hi, tuaciang hong kisim tu zongh lau om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in ka pa David munah, ‘Nang zawkciang kumpi ka suasak tu na tapa in kei atu biakinn hong saksak tu hi,’ ci in kamciam pia hi. Tuaciang tu in Topa ka Pathian a kibiak natu tua biakinn khat sak tu ka khensat zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahikom kei atu Lebanon ah cedar kungte phuk tu in na mite na paisak in. Keima mite zongh amate taw diangkhawm tu a, tuaciang nangma ii khensat babang thaman pia tu khi hi. Na heak bangma, ka mite in thingphuzia sia na mite thiam bangin thiam ngawl hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Solomon ii kam thaakte a saan ciang Hiram lungkim mama a, “Ngamlian tuasia uk tu in David a laih tu kumpi tapa ciim khat a piak hu in Topa tu ni in pok vun!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Hiram in Solomon munah hi bangin kam thaak hi: “Na kam hong thaak nga khi hi, tuaciang nong nget bangin seam tu kithoai zo khi hi. Cedar thing le taakthing teng hong sik tu khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka mite in thingluangte Lebanon panin tuipi dong hong paipui tu a, tuate sawmkhawm in phong ka vawtsak zawkciang nangma tealna tuipi vaal mun khat ah hong taaisuksak tu khi hi. Tua munah ka mite in phel in, tuaciang na mite in vaipuak la tu hi. Nangma in ka mite nguai an nong piaksak tu ka dei hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahikom Hiram in Solomon sia cedar luang le taak luang a dei za sik hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tuaciang, Solomon in Hiram sia kum simin a mite a vaak natu zungtaang taan 2,000 le olive thau thiang litre 400,000 sik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa in a kamciam lenin Solomon sia ciimna pia hi. Hiram le Solomon kilaklaw ah kilemna om hi, tuaciang amate ngeal sia khat le khat kihu natu thukimna lai kho khat vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kumpipa Solomon in Israel ngam bup panin zawthawk thu taw a kisawl naseam tu 30,000 khon hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tuaciang Adoniram sia tuate uk tu in koi hi. Ama in tua mi teng sia pawlkhat ciang mihing 10,000 veu pawl thum in khen a, Lebanon ah thakhat veu diangsakin, tha nii veu ciasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Solomon in mualtung ngam ah suang to tu mihing 80,000, tua suangte a pua tu mihing 70,000 nei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />ama in tuate ii nasep a encik tu in a uk 3300 koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Solomon ii thupiakna taw Biakinnpi tawdap atu a hoi suangtum liante tosak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Solomon le Hiram ii naseamte le Byblos khuapi pan pasalte in suangtum le thingte Biakinnpi sak natu in pua pha hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel mite ii Egypt a nusiat zawk kum zali le kum sawmliat zawk, Solomon ii maan zawk kum lina, a tha niina, Ziv tha sungah Solomon in Biakinnpi sak kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A sungsang a sauna metre 27 pha a, metre 9 zai in, metre 13.5 saang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A tumna inndoi sia metre 4.5 saangin, a zaina metre 9 hi a, biakinnpi cia ma zai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Biakinnpi ii pangte ah a om a hawngvang te sia a sungsang sangin a puasang ciakzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Biakinnpi ii panghte le a nungsangah inn pepna inndawl thum khat sia a pang puasang nealin sa a, dawl khat simin metre 2.2 veu saang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A dawl nuainungbel ii a inndoi khat sim metre 2.2 veu zai a, a dawl laizang sia metre 2.7 zai in, a dawl tungnungbel sia metre 3.1 zai hi. Suatte tungah om biakinn pang sia a nuai suat ah omte sangin pazaw ahiciang a inndoite sia pang sungah suatthal phum kul ngawl a, pang tungah kinga thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Biakinnpi a sak tatak ciang sek, hei, le thik vanhzakte ii ngin a kizaak ngawl tu in, Biakinnpi sak natu suangtumte sia suangkhuk sungah kivawt khol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Innpi pepna ii a dawl nuainungbel tumna sia Biakinnpi ii thang sangah om a, tua mun panin a dawl niina le a thumna pai natu kealleite kithung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuabangin Solomon kumpipa in Biakinnpi a sak man hi. Ama in innciingdap sia cedar thingpheakte le innsunhte taw vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Dawl thum a pha inn pepna sia metre 2.2 saang a, inndoi simin Biakinnpi pang pua nung sia neal in kisa a, cedar innsunhte taw kipee-awsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in Solomon munah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Ka thukhamte le ka thupiak te na zui le na pa David tungah sep tu a ka kamciam teng nang atu seam tu khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tu a na sak hi Biakinnpi sung, Israel ka mite sungah kong teang tu a, tuaciangin amate ka nusia ngei buatu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuabangin Solomon in Biakinnpi a sak man hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Biakinnpi sung sang pangte sia suat tung pan innciingdap dong cedar thing pheakte taw kituam a, tuaciang a suat teng taakthing kizangh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A sung sang inndoi khat, Thiangtho belh Mun a kici sia Biakinnpi ii nungsangah kisa hi. Tua sia metre 9 sau in, cedar thingpheak a kilhkhopte taw kidoi a, suat tung panin innciingdap dong phato hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thiangthobel Mun ii mai ah a om inndoi sia metre 18 sau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cedar thingpheakte sia uum ngate le paak a kikhuak limte taw kizeam hi; a sungsang bup sia cedar thingpheak taw kituam a, tua hu in pangin a kiciang suangte kimu thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Biakinnpi nungsangah Topa ii Thuciamna Thingkuang koi natu in inn sungnung inndoi khat kisa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hi inn sungsang inndoi sia metre 9 sau a, metre 9 zai in, metre 9 saang hi, a buppi in khamh ciitak taw kituam hi. Biaknatau sia cedar thingpheakte taw kituam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Biakinnpi sungsang sia khamh taw kituam a, khamh taw ma a kituam a inndoi sungnung tumna sia khaamtan in khamh kual kipeete kithung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Biakinnpi sungsang buppi khamh taw kituam a, Thiangthobel Mun aa biaknatau sia zongh khamh taw kituam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Meter 4.4 veve a saang Cherub lim nii sia olive thing taw kivawt a, Thiangthobel Mun ah kikoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuate ngeal a letna le a lim a meal kibang hi. Khatsimin tha nii tek nei hi. Tuaciang a thate khat ciang metre 2.2 sau hi, tua ahikom a kiphal a tha dawn khat pan dawn khat dong metre 4.4 pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuate ngeal sia Thiangthobel Mun ah a kicial in kikoi in, a tha kiphalte dawn veve a inndoi laizang santak ah kiphasak a, tuaciang a tha dangte nii in pangte pha uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cherub te a nii in khamh taw kituam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A inndoipi pangte le a sungnung inndoi pangte sia a khetkuak cherub te ii limte, palm thingkung limte le paak limte taw kizeam siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A suat ngawngawn khamh taw kituam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Olive thing taw a kivawt bangkua a kipee nii te sia Thiangthobel Mun tumna ah kikoi hi; a kongbiang tung santak sia a tung zumin a kawn khat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kongkhate sia cherub lim te, palm thingkung limte le paak limte taw kizeam a, khamh taw kituam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Inndoipi sung tumna kongkhamung sia siik li nei in olive thing taw kivawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Kongkha kithep thei nii sia taakthing taw kivawt a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />cherub limte, palm thingkung lim le paak lim te taw kizeam hi, tuate sia a kibang kim in khamh taw kituam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Zum sungnung sia Biakinnpi ii mai ah kisa a, pangte taw ki uum in, tuate atu in suang ngual thuap thum simin cedar thingpim ngual khat veu kician nelh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Biakinnpi ii tawdap sia Solomon kumpi maan zawk a kum lina a tha niina Ziv tha sungah kiciang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Solomon ii maan zawk a kum sawm le kum khat a tha liatna Bul tha sung ah, a kingeal bang lianin kiman thiang hi. Solomon atu tuasia a sak na in kum sali hai hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Solomon in ama atu zong kumpi inn khat sa si a, kum sawm le kum thum hai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lebanon Thingtaam Inndoipi sia metre 44 sau a, metre 22 zai in, metre 13.5 saang hi. Cedar khuam sawm le nga veu ngual thum om a, tuate khat sim tungah a kinga zawlliang kithung hi. Innciingdap sia cedar hi a, vanh kholna inndoite tung liap hi, tuate sia khuamte taw kinang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A pangte ngeal ah khelki ngual thum veu om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua kongbiangte le a khelkite sia a pangh kikim king li nei veu hi a, tuaciang pang khat sim tungah khelki ngual thumte in a langkhat ngualte maingat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khuamngual te ii Inndoipi sia metre 22 sau a, metre 13.5 zai hi. A tung siin nei a, khuamte in nang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kumpi Tokhum omna Inndoi sia Thukhenna Inndoi zongh kici a, Solomon ii a thukhenna mun ahi hi, tuasia suat tung panin tuukpite dong cedar thingpheakte taw kivawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Solomon teenna inn sia Thukhenna Inndoi ii nungsangah inn dangte sak bangma in kisa hi. A zi, Egypt kumpipa ii tanu atu zongh tua taw kibangin inn saksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hi innte theampo le a suum lianpi sia a tawdap pan kipan bitha dong suangphate taw kivawt hi. A suangte sia a suangkhuk ah a pha tu cia kivawt khol a, a sungsang le a puasang panghte sia thingatnam taw kingiamh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A tawdap tu sia suangtum liante taw suangkhuk ah kivawt a, pawlkhat sia metre 3:5, pawlkhat sia metre 4 sau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuate ii tungah a phabek tu a at sa suang dangte le cedar thingpim te taw kisa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kumpi inn suum, Biakinnpi suum sungnung le Biakinnpi tumna inndoite ii pangte sia suang tansa ngual thum simin cedar thingpim ngual khat veu thekin kisa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Solomon kumpipa in taau taw nasep a thiam Tyre khuapi ah a teang, khutthiamna a nei Huram a kici pasal khat sam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A thi zo a pa sia Tyre pan hi a, ama zongh taau taw nasep a thiam khat ma hi; a nu sia Naphtali nam pan ahi hi. Huram sia a pil, khutthiam nasep a seam ngeisa ahi hi. Ama in taau taw nasepna theampo a uk tu in Solomon kumpipa ii sapna a saang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huram in taau khuampi nii vawt hi, khat simin metre 8 saang a, a kiimkot sia metre 5.3 pha hi, tuate sia Biakinnpi tumna munah koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in tua khuampite ii tungkhu tu in taau metre 2.2 veve a sau zongh vawt si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khuampite ii a dawn veve sia thikkhau kipheakte ii lim la in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />taau taw a kivawt talee nga lim ngual nii veve taw zongh zeam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A tung khu sia unok paak bangin kivawt in, metre 1.8 sau a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />tuate sia a kawnin a kivawt a tungkhu thikkhau pheak bang ahi sia ii tungah kikoi hi. A tungkhu khat sim ii kiim ah talee nga ngual nii in a kingual pum 200 om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huram in hi taau khuampite nii sia Biakinnpi tumna mai ah koi hi: a thangsang a sia Jachin ci a, a saksang a sia Boaz kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Unok paak taw kibang taau tungkhute sia tua khuampite dawn ah kinga hi. Tuabangin khuampite taw kisai nasepna kiman hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huram in tuikuang khat sia a beamin vawt hi, metre 2.2 thuk a, a khuangmai sia metre 4.4 ahi hi, a kiimkot sia metre 13.2 ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuikuang ii a ngong puasang kiil kiim theampo taau uum nga lim ngual nii om a tuikuang taw sakhat suak in taau kisung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuikuang sia a puasang a ngaa, khuital lim sawm le nii te ii nungzaang ah tosak hi, thum veu khen in mun khat sang tek ngaa sak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuikuang ii pangh sia millimetre 75 saa hi. A ngong sia hai ngong taw kibang a, a pua sangah paal in, unok paakpalh bang ahi hi. Tua tuikuang sungah litre 40,000 bang taa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huram in taau taw leang sawm vawt si hi; khat simin metre 1.8 sau a, metre 1.8 zai in, metre 1.3 saang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuate sia a paona nei kiing li kikim taau a pheakte taw kivawt a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />tawpi lim, khuital lim le cherub limte tua taaupheakte tungah kingelh hi; a paona mungte tungah a om tawpi le khuital limte ii tung le, a kivial limte om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Leang khat simin taau mui li veu, taau zawlte tungah kibul hi. A leang ii king li simin kuangpui nanna, taau taw a kivawt khuam note om a; tuate sia a kivial limte taw kizeam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua tungah kuangpui ngak natu valh kawn khat om hi. Tuasia in leang tungah centimetre 45 dok to a, tuasia sungah centimetre 18 tum suk hi. Tuasia ii kiim ah thing ngelhte kivawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Leangmuite sia centimetre 66 saang hi; Tuate sia taaupheakte nuai ah om a, a leang zawlte sia a leangte taw sakhat in kivawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Leangmuite sia siphu ngalleangmuite taw kibang hi; leangzawlte, a mui kiil te le a mui letna ciangte le a mui kamhnate sia taau vive ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Leang khat ii a king sim ah a nuai pan a nannate zongh leang taw sa khat ma ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Centimetre 22 a beak taau kual khat veu leang khat sim tungah om hi; tua ii nannate le taaupheakte sia leang taw sa khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A nannate le taaupheakte sia cherubim, tawpite le palm thingkung limte taw a awng napo ah kizeamin, lim a kivialte taw a kiimkot theampo ah kizeam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tua hi a, hi bangin leangte kivawt hi; tuate khat le khat kibang hi, a phakcia le a pianzia kibang kim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Huram in leang khat atu khat veu kuangpui sawm vawt si hi. Kuangpuite khat sim ii a khuangmai metre 1.8 veu zai a, tuaciang kuang simin litre 800 taa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ama in leang nga sia Biakinnpi thang sangah koi a, a om lai nga teng saksang ah koi hi; tuikuang sia nisuana thang sang king ah koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Huram in bealte, leiluana kawkeaute le kuangte zongh vawt hi. Ama in Solomon kumpipa atu in Topa Biakinnpi atu a nasep theampo khuangkhim zo hi. Hi sia ama ii vawt teng ahi hi; Khuampi niite Khuampi dawn ah kuangno taw a kibang khuam tungkhu nii, Khuam tungkhu khat sim tungah a kipheak thikkhau Khuam tungkhu kiimkot ah 100 veu ngual nii in a kisuai, talee nga lim 400 Leang sawmte, Kuangpui sawmte Tuikuang Tuikuang ngakna khuital sawm le nii Bealte, kawkeaute le kuangte Hi Biakinnpi vanh zak tu in Huram ii Solomon kumpipa atu a vawtte sia a kinawt sa taau taw kivawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Kumpipa in tuate theampo sia Jordan Kuam sung Sukkoth le Zarethan kilaklaw ah a om thikseakna munah vawtsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Solomon in hi taau vanh te khaitee sak ngawl hi, banghang ziam ci le tam lei ahikom a ngitna kituat ngeingawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Solomon in Biakinnpi atu khamh vanhzakte zongh vawtsak hi: biaknatau, Pathian tung anluum piakna sabuai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Thiangthobel Mun ii mai ah a ding meivak khuam sawm, a saksang ah nga, a thang sangah nga a koite; paakte, meiinnte le taiteete;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />haite, taitee, kuangte, meikam toaina bealte; Thiangthobel Mun kongkhate le Biakinnpi puasang kongkhate ii pattaate ahi hi. Hi na zakte theampo sia khamh taw kivawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Kumpipa Solomon in Biakinnpi tungtaang ah nasep tu teng a man ciangin a pa David ii Topa tungah a aap tuamsa na teng — ngunn, khamh le a dang nate sia biakinn vanh kholna inndoite sungah koi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Kumpipa Solomon in Topa ii Thuciamna Thingkuang sia David ii khuapi Zion panin Biakinnpi ah a tua tu in Israel ngamsung namte le, bee le phungte ii lampui theampo Jerusalem ama kungah hong pai tu in sam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amate teng in Ethanim tha, a tha sali tha Buk Poai hun sungin kikhawmtua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A lampuite theampo a kikaikhop zawkciang, thiampite in Thuciamna Thingkuang laamto uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tuaciang Biakinnpi ah hong pua uh hi. Levi te le thiampite in Topa ii ompuina Puanbuk le tua taw kisai vanh teng zongh Biakinnpi ah khiin uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kumpipa Solomon le Israel mite theampo Thuciamna Thingkuang ii mai ah hong kikhawmtua in, khui le tuu tam mama sangaw biakpiakna in nei uh hi — tam lei ahikom kisim zo ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua zawkciang thiampite in Thuciamna Thingkuang sia Biakinnpi sungah hong tum pui in, cherub te ii nuai Thiangthobel Mun sungah koi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A thakhui kizalhte in thingkuang le a puakna molte siin uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thiangthobel Mun ii mai san tak ah a dingte bek in tua molte ii mongte mu thei a, koima dang pan kimu thei ngawl hi. (Molpumte sia tu ni in tua munah om lai hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thuciamna Thingkuang sungah, Egypt ngam panin Israel mite a pusua lai in Sinai mual tungah Topa in amate taw thuciamna a vawt ciangin Moses ii koi tua suangpheak nii te simngawl, nadang bangma om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thiampite in Biakinnpi a nusiat laitak thakhat thu in tuasia meeikaai taw kidim in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa ii ompuina hu in khuavak taang velvol sia taw kidim a, amate sia a vaipuakte seam tu in pai kik thei nawn ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Solomon in thungen hi: “Nang, Topa in van ah ni na koi hi, tua hi napi nang in meeikaai sung le khuazing sungah om tu na teal zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tu in a tuanngen biakinn khat nang atu kong saksak zo hi, a tawntungin na ten natu mun ahi hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mipite tua munah a din uh ciangin Kumpipa Solomon in amate maingat tu in kihei a, tuaciang ama in mipite atu in Pathian thupha ngetsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in, “Israel ii Topa Pathian pok vun! Ama in ka pa David tungah hi bangin a ci, a kamciam kholet a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />‘Egypt ngam panin ka mite ka paipui hun pan kipan, Israel ngam bup sungah kei hong kibiak natu in biakinnpi sak natu khuapi khat zongh ka teal bua hi. Ahihang, ka mite uk tu in David nang kong teal hi,’ ” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaciang Solomon in a thuson zom a, “Ka pa David in Israel ii Topa Pathian a biak natu biakinn khat sak tu ngeal hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />ahihang Topa in ama munah, ‘Kei atu biakinn na sak nop sia maan ni hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />ahihang nang in na sa ngei buatu hi. Na tapa, nangma ii tapa tilteal in ka biakinn sa tu hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Tu in Topa in a kamciam kholet hi. Israel kumpi suak in ka pa za ka laih zo hi, tuaciang Israel ii Topa Pathian biak natu in Biakinnpi ka sa zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Egypt ngam panin ih taanghpupite a pusua pui lai in Topa in amate taw thuciamna suangpheak nii a om Thuciamna Thingkuang koi natu mun khat zongh Biakinnpi sungah ka vawtsak hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaciang mipite omna biaknatau mai ah Solomon ding a, a khut laamin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />thu ngen hi, “Israel ii Topa Pathian awng, a tungsang vantung ah ahizong, a nuaisang lei tungah ahizong nang taw a kibang pathian om ngawl hi! Na mite taw na thuciamna na kholet a, amate in thin theampo taw na thu hong ni in a nuntak ciangin na itna na lak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka pa David tungah na kamciam sia na kholet hi; tu ni in na kammalte theampo taangtung zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaciang tu in Israel ii Topa Pathian awng, ka pa tungah kamciam na vawt dang khat ahi, ama ii na thu hong nit bangin amate in kidopna taw thuni pole, ama suan le paalte sung pan khat in Israel kumpi in maang tawntung tu hi, na ci sia zongh nong taangtunsak natu thu kong ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ahikom tu in Israel ii Pathian awng, na naseampa ka pa David tungah kamciam na piakte theampo zongh taangtungsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Ahihang, Oh Pathian awng, nang leitung ah teang thei takpi tu ni ziam? Vantung theampo zongh nang hong huam tu in lian tham ngawl hi, tua ahikom hi Biakinnpi kei ii sak sia lian khom thong tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Topa ka Pathian awng, kei sia na naseampa khi hi. Ka thungetna hong za ta'n a, tu ni a kong ngetnate hong pia ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hi Biakinnpi, nang hong kibiak natu in na tealsa hi mun sia a sun a zanin na cing in. Hi mun maingat in thu kong nget ciangin hong za ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kei ii thungetna le na mite ii hi mun maingat in thu hong nget ciang hong za ta'n. Vantung na inn sung panin hong za ta'n a, kote hong maisak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Mihing khat sia midang khat tungah khial hi ci in a kimawsiat ciangin, a khial ngawlna thu a kilangh natu in kiciamna nei tu in hi Biakinnpi sung na biaknatau ah a kipaipui ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Oh Topa , vantung pan na ngai in a, na naseamte tungah thu hong khen ta'n. A maw sia tungah a kiphu bangin daan na pia in, a maw ngawl sia na tha in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Na Israel mite sia nangma tungah hong maw hu in a ngalte in zo hi, tuaciang amate in nang sang hong heak a, kiniamkhiakin maw maisak natu in thu hong ngen le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />vantung panin na ngai in. Na mite ii mawna khialnate maisak in a, tuaciang a taanghpupite tungah na piak ngam le lei ah na ciapui kik in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Na mite in nang tungah hong maw zo ahi hu in nguatuite na hansak ciang le, amate kisiik in hi Biakinnpi sang nga in kiniamkhiakin thu hong nget ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />vantung pan na ngai in. Kumpipa le Israel mite ii mawna khialna te, na maisak in. A maan bang a ngamtat natu amate na hil in. Tuaciang, Oh Topa , na mite ii a tawntung a neisa tu in na piak hi na leitang tungah nguatui na puak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Ngam sungah kialpi, ahibuale natsia tungin, ahibuale ankungte vuisa, ahibuale khaumaw hon in a lalsak ciang, tua ahibuale na mite a ngalte in a sim ciang, tua ahibualaile amate sungah natna satna a om ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />amate ii thungetna na ngai in. Israel na mite khat pawpo in thin heena tatak lakin, hi Biakinnpi sangah a khut uh zan in thu hong ngen le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />ama te thungetna za in. Vantung na inn sung panin amate ngetna na ngai in a, a mawna maisak in, na hu in. Nangma bekma in mihing thinsung ngaisutna te he ni hi. Mi simin ama taw a kiphu bangin a tungah na vawt in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />tua hile koma a taanghpupite tungah na piak ngam le lei tungah amate ii teen sung tawntung na thu hong ni tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />“A khuala a om ngamdang mi khat in na minthanna le, na mite atu na lianpi na sepna te za in, hi Biakinnpi ah nangma bia tu hong pai in thu hong ngen le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />a thungetna na ngai in. Vantung na teenna pan za in a, vawtsak tu in hong nget teng vawtsak in, tua hile leitung mite theampo in Israel na mite ii hong heak bangma hong he thei in, na thu hong ni tu uh hi. Tuasia ciang amate in hi Biakinnpi ka sak sia nangma biak natu mun ahi hunlam he tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />“A ngalte uh taw kido tu in kuan a, na sawl ciang na mite in nang tungah thu hong ngen a, koisung po ah a om zong na tealsa hi khuapi le nang atu ka sak Biakinnpi te maingat in thu hong nget ciangin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />amate ii thungetna na ngai in. Vantung panin na za in a, zawna na pia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />“Na mite in khialna vawtin nang hong langpan ciang — a maw ngawl khat zongh om ngawl ahiciang — na thin uukin a, a ngalte in zosak in ngamdang ah thongtaak tu in amate a paipui ciang bangza po in tua ngam sia a khuala ta zong,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />na mite ii thungetna ngai in. Tua ngam pan amate kisik kikin na tungah a seksolna le a mawna pualaak in thu hong ngen le, amate thungetna na ngai in, Oh Topa awng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tua ngam ah amate in thin tak le thu maan takin kisiik a, ka taanghpupite tungah na piak sa, hi ngam, na tealsa hi khuapi le nang atu ka sak hi Biakinnpi sia maingat in thu hong ngen le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />tuasia ciang amate ii thungetna na ngai in. Vantung na inn sung panin tuate za in a, amate tungah hesuakna na nei in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Amate ii mawna khialna le hong le do na sia maisak in a, tuaciang a ngalte sia amate tungah dikna na laksak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Amate sia na mihingte hi a, tua meiphual lingh na Egypt pan na pusuasakte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />“Vaanglianpipa Topa, na Israel mite le a kumpipa tungah maipha na pia tawntung in a, amate in hu ngen in hong sap simin a thungetna uh na za in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Koma taanghpupite Egypt pan na pusuapui lai in na naseampa Moses tungah na sonsa bangma in mihing theampo sung pan amate sia nangma mi tu in na teal hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Solomon in Topa tungah a thunget a man zawkciang khut laamin khupdin a, a om na biaknatau mai pan dingto hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Ama in tua munah a kikhawm mite theampo tungah Pathian ii thuphate a tun natu in awnging tak taw ngen hi. Ama in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Ama mite munah ngal kilemna a piak tu in, a kamciam bangma ngal kilemna hong pia “ Topa pok vun. A naseampa Moses tungtawnin ngo takin a piak kamciam theampo len hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Topa ih Pathian in ih taanghpupite taw a omkhop bangin ei taw hong omkhawm tahen; hong nusia ngei heak hen a, hong taisan heak hen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />ama dei bangin ih nuntak tawntung thei natu le ih taanghpupite tungah a piak thukhamte le thupiakna te theampo ih kepcing thei natu, ama ii thu a ni thei tu in hong vawt tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Topa ih Pathian in ama tungah hi thu ngetna le thuumna ka vawtte a tawntungin hong tepteesak tahen. Israel mite le a kumpipa tungah ni simin a kitaangsap uh bangin ama in hong hesuak tawntung tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Tuabangin leitung minamte theampo in Topa ama bek Pathian hi a — a dang Pathian om ngawl hi ci in he tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />No, ama mite in Topa ih Pathian tungah thumaan tawntung vun a, a thukhamte le a thupiakte tu ni a na zui uh bangin zui thei tawntung tavun.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Kumpipa Solomon le mite theampo in Topa tungah sangaw biakpiakna vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Ama in khui 22,000 le tuu 120,000 sia kipawlkhop biakpiakna in pia hi. Tuabangin kumpipa le a mite theampo in Biakinnpi aaptuam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Tua ni ma in ama in Biakinnpi mai leitual laizang sia, thiangthosak hi, tua munah ama in pum bup a kihal sangaw biakpiaknate, antang biakpiaknate le nganno ii thau te taw kipawlkhop biakpiaknate vawt hi. Ama ii hi bangin a vawtna sia hi biakpiakna theampo atu, taau biaknatau teng sia biakpiak natu in no leih ahihang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Tua mun Biakinnpi ah Solomon le mite theampo in a Buk Poai sia ni sali sung vawt uh hi. Tua munah saksang Hamath Mualciangh pek pan le thangsang Egypt ngamngi pan hong pai mihon tam mama om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />A ni liat ni ciang Solomon in mipite ciasak hi. Amate theampo in ama pok a, lungdam in cia uh hi, banghang ziam cile Topa in a naseampa David le a mi Israel te thuphate a piak hu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Solomon kumpipa in Biakinnpi, kumpi inn le a dang a sak nop teng a sak zawkciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Gibeon ah Topa a kilaak bangin ama tungah kilaak kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa in ama munah, “Na thungetna hong za zo khi hi. A tawntungin kei hong kibiak natu in na sak, hi Biakinnpi koituam khi hi. Ka encik tu a ka keamcing tawntung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thumaanna le phinciingna taw na pa David ii sep bangin keima ii na seamin, ka thukhamte na zui a, kong thupiak theampo na vawt le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />na pa David tungah kamciam ka piak, Israel sia ama ii suan le paalte in uk tawntung tu hi, ka ci sia ka kholet tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahihang nangma ahibuale na suan na paalte in kei nong zui nawn bua uh a, ka thukhamte le kong thupiakte zui ngawlin pathian dangte na bia uh le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tuasia ciang ka Israel mite sia ka piaksa ngam panin ka heam tu hi. Kei hong kibiak natu in ka koituam sa, hi Biakinnpi zongh ka nusia tu hi. Mun theampo pan mihingte in Israel sia nunau tu a, simmaw tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hi Biakinnpi sia zaanciim in kisengneng tu a, a kaantan in a pai theampo liinglawng tu uh a lamdang sa in, ‘Banghangin Topa in hi ngam le hi Biakinnpi tungah hi bangin ngamta ziam?’ ci in kidongh tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mihingte in ‘Banghang ziam cile Egypt ngam panin a taanghpupite a pusua, a Pathian a nusiat uh hu hi. Pathian dangte tungah kinga a, a biak hu in Topa in hi tuasiatna amate tungah tungsak hi,’ ci in kizo tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Biakinnpi le ama kumpi innte a sak hun kum kul ngei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tyre kumpipa Hiram in hi nasepna atu a kisamh cedar thing le taakthing teng ahizong, khamh theampo ahizong sik siat hi. Tuasia a kiman zawkciang Solomon kumpipa in Hiram sia Galilee ngamkhen sungah khua kul pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hiram pai in a mu ciangin tua khuate dei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahikom ama in Solomon munah, “Tua ahile, suapui awng, kei nong piak khuate hi teng ahi ziam!” ci hi. Hi sia hu in tua mun le ngam teng Cabul kici lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hiram in Solomon khamh kilogramme tul li vaal pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kumpipa Solomon in Biakinnpi sak natu, kumpi inn sak natu le khuapi ii nisuana sang teng lei vuk natu le khuapi luphung cian natu in, zawthawk thu taw a kisawl naseamte zangh hi. Amate in khuapite ahi Hazor, Megiddo, le Gezer khuate saat natu in tuate ma zangh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />(Egypt kumpipa in Gezer simin la zo a, a teang khua mite thatin, a khuapi haltum hi. Tua zawkciang tua khuapi sia a tanu le Solomon hong kiteen uh ciang mo thaakna letsong in pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaciang Solomon in sa kik hi.) Zawthawk thu taw a kisawl naseamte ma zangh a, Solomon in Beth Horon khua Nuainung zongh saat kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Baalath, Judah duisung ah a om Tamar,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />a anneak a vanh zakte kholna khuapite, a siphute le a siphu ngalleangte kholna khuapite, inn a sak nopna dang theampo ah Jerusalem, Lebanon le a uk sung mun dangte sung zongh ah tua naseamte zangh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Solomon in zawthawk thu taw a kisawl nasep seam tu in Israel mite ii a ngam a suan lai in a thalup mong Canaan mite ii suan le paalte zangh uh hi. Hite sungah Amor te, Hit te, Periz te, Hiv te le Jebus te kihel in, tuate ii suan le paalte sia tu ni dong sila ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Solomon in Israel te sila in a khoai bua hi; amate in a ngalkap no, ngalkap bu, ngalkap uk, siphu ngalleang uk le siphu ngalkap veu seamsak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Solomon ii inn sak natu nasep tuatuamte sungah ulian 550 in zawthawk thu taw a kisawl naseamte uk uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Solomon in a zi, Egypt kumpipa tanu atu a saksak kumpi inn ah David khuapi pan a khiin zawkciang, khuapi ii nisuana sang teng lei vuksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kum khat sung thumvei veu Solomon in meihal biakpiakna le kipawlkhop biakpiaknate Topa atu a sak sa biaknatau tungah pia hi. Ama in Topa atu ngimnamtuite zongh hal hi. Tuabangin ama in Biakinnpi sakna man hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Solomon in Edom ngam Aqaba Tuidok vaal ah a om Elath taw kinai, Eziongeber ah teambaw honkhat vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kumpipa Hiram in a teambaw naseam thiam sa pawlkhat Solomon mite taw seam khawm tu in puak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amate in Ophir ngam ah teambaw taw pai in khamh kilogramme 14,000 bang Solomon kungah cia pui uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sheba kumpinu in Solomon minthanna za a, tuaciang thudokna haksa pawlkhat taw ama ze et tu in Jerusalem ah haw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in a lalangte honpui khat, hel namtuite, suangmanpha le khamh tam ma a pua kalaoh te hong paipui hi. Ama le Solomon a kisik ciangin a ngaisut thei za taw thu doknate nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Solomon in tua teng zo thei siat hi; ama a tu zo mawk tu a haksa leih bangma om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sheba kumpinu in Solomon ii ciimna za a, kumpi inn a sak sia mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kumpinu in kumpipa sabuai ah a kilui ante, a uliante ii teenna innte, kumpi inn sung naseamte ii nasep hawm zia le a puansilhte, poaipi khaam ciang a sabuai ngak naseamte le Biakinnpi sungah a sangaw biakpiaknate mu hi. Ama in husamh liangin lamdang sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in Kumpipa Solomon munah, “Ka ngam panin na ciimna le nangma thu kong zaakte maan siat hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahihang hong pai a keima tatak ma in ka mu mateng ka um thei bua hi. Ahihang a lang zongh za ngawl lai hi nginge khi hi; na ciimna le na hauna te kei tungah hong kiko za sangin nasia zaw lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na zite bangza in hampha uh ziam! Na ciimna kammalte hong za tawntung, na kung a om, na naseamte zongh hampha mama hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa na Pathian pok in! Ama in nang Israel kumpipa hong suasak ciang nang tungah a lungkimzia ama in lak zo hi. Ama ii Israel te hong itna kip tawntung ahikom, nang sia thukham le thutang khenna na kepcing thei natu in, amate kumpi hong suaksak zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in Solomon kumpipa tungah letsong hong paipui teng: khamh kilogramme 4,000 vaal, hel namtuite le suangmanpha tam mama pia hi. Tua hel namtui teng sia ama ii vanh saan ngei theampo sung pan a nasiabel ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />(Ophir panin khamh hong ciapui Hiram ii teambaw te in juniper thing le suangmanpha zongh hong ciapui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Solomon in tua thingte taw Biakinnpi le kumpi inn dalna te, tuaciang music thiamte atu tengtongh le liamlo vawtna in nei hi. Tuate sia Israel ngam sungah a kiciapui ngei juniper thing phabel teng po pan a phabel hi; hi bangte bangma hunin kimu kik ngei nawn ngawl hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kumpipa Solomon in Sheba kumpinu sia ngo takin a kipiak ngei letsongte vaalin a nget theampo pia hi. Tua zawkciang ama le a lalangte Sheba ngam ah cia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kum simin Solomon Kumpipa in khamh kilogramme 23,000 dektak nga hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tua banah sumvawtte ii shia piakte, sumzuak sumleina tung pan a meet, le Arab kumpite le Israel ngamkhen uk mangte ii piak shia te zongh nga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Solomon in lum a lian 200 vawtsak a, khat simin khamh kilogramme 7 dektak taw veu zeamsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in lum a no zaw 300 zongh vawtsak a, khamh kilogramme 2 dektak taw veu zeamsak hi. Ama in hi lumte teng Lebanon Thingtaam Inndoipi sungah koisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in kumpipa tokhum lian khat zongh vawtsak hi. Tuasia ii khen khat sia saiha taw tuam a, a taanglai teng khamh phabel taw tuam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kumpi tokhum kung thet to natu keallei dawl luk om in, a dawl khat ii mong sim ah tawpi lim khat veu taw a vekpi tawpi lim sawm le nii om hi. Kumpi tokhum ii nungsangah khuital lu ii lim suang a, a khut ngakna baan te nii pangh ah tawpi lim khat veve kivawt hi. Kumpi ngam koima dang ah hi bang kumpi tokhum om ngeingawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Solomon ii hai theampo khamh taw kivawt hi, tuaciang Lebanon Thingtaam Inndoipi sung a, ankuang ankeau theampo khamh ciitak taw kivawt hi. Solomon hun lai in ngunn sia a manpha in kingaisun ngawl ahikom ngunn kizangh ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama in tuipi teambaw hon nei a, Hiram ii teambaw hon taw paikhawmsak hi. Kum thum simin ama teambaw hon sia heak kik in, khamh, ngunn, saiha, zawng te le mei nei ngawl zawngku puite ciapui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Solomon kumpipa sia kumpi dang khat pawpo sangin hau zawin ciim zaw hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />tuaciang, leitung bup in Pathian ii piaksa ama ii ciim kam pauna te ngai tu in hong pai nuam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hong pai peuma in ama letsong khat veu — ngunn le khamh taw a kivawt nate, puantualte, ngalhiam te, hel namtuite, siphute le laate puak hi. Kum khat zawk kum khat tuabangin kipia tan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Solomon in siphu ngalleang 1,400, ngalsim siphu 12,000 nei hi. Tuate pawlkhat Jerusalem ah koi a, a dang teng khuapi dang ah koi kawkoai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama ii uk hun sungin ngunn sia suang bangma in Jerusalem khua sungah om a, cedar sia sycomore thing thawthong za in Judah mualpeangte ah tam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kumpipa ii taang mite in Musri le Cilicia pan ngamdang a puak tu siphute,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />tuaciang Egypt pan ngamdang a puak tu siphu ngalleangte saisak uh hi. Amate in Hit mite le Syria kumpipate atu, siphu le siphu ngalleangte vaihawmsak in, siphu ngalleang khat ciang ngunntang 600, siphu khat ngunntang 150 taw zuak uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Solomon in ngamdang numeite tam ma it hi. Egypt kumpipa ii tanu bek hi ngawl, Hit, Moab, Ammon, Edom le Sidon pan numeite teenpui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in Israel te sia hi mite taw a kiteen ngawl natu thupia hi, banghang ziam cile tua mite in Israel mite sia pathian dangte tungah thumaan zaw tu ahi hang hi, tua hi napi ama in amate teenpui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Solomon in kumpi tanute 700 teenpui a, zino 300 nei si hi. Amate in Solomon sia Pathian nung ngat in omsak hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tuaciang a khanhaam hun ciangin amate in ngamdang pathiante biakna sungah tumpui hi. Ama in Topa a Pathian tungah a pa David ii thumaan bangza in thumaan ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in Sidon te ii numeipathian Astarte, tuaciang Ammon te ii a thasiathuai pathian Molech bia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A pa David bang hi ngawl a, ama in Topa tungah khialin a tungah thumaan ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jerusalem nisuana sang mual tungah Moab te ii a thasiathuai pathian Chemosh biak natu mun khat, tuaciang Ammon te ii a thasiathuai pathian Molech biak natu mun vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A ngamdang zite ii ngimnamtui a hal natu le sangaw biakpiaknate amate tek ii pathiante tungah a nei thei natu in biakna munte zongh vawtsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa, Israel te ii Pathian in niivei tak Solomon tungah kilaak a, ngamdang pathiante a biak ngawl natu thupia hikale Topa thu ni ngawlin nungngat hi. Tua ahikom Topa sia Solomon tungah thin uuk a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />ama tungah, “Nang sia kei taw na thuciamna palsat kaltang in, ka thupiakte zui ngawl na hikom na kumpi ngam kong laaksak tu a, na uliante khat pia tu in ka kamciam om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahihang na pa David ka khualna in hisia na nuntak sungin ka vawt buatu a, na tapa ii uk hun sungin piang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaciang ama ii kumpi ngam bup ka la buatu hi; ama atu sia ka naseampa David le keima atu ka vawtsa Jerusalem khuapi ka khualna in minam khat ka nusiat zaw tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahikom Topa in Edom kumpi bangkua pan Hadad sia Solomon langpansak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hi hun ma pek in, David in Edom a zawthal lai in, a ngalkaphonpi ukpa Joab sia tua munah a thite ii luang phum tu in pai zo hi. Ama le a mite Edom ah tha luk a taam hun sungin Edom mite pa a minpiang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hadad le a pa ii naseam Edom mi pawlkhat Egypt ngam zuan in a suakta teng simngawl thatlum siat hi. (Tua hun lai in Hadad sia patangno khat hi pheang hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate in Midian nusia in Paran ah pai a, tua munah mi pawlkhat in amate pawm hi. Tua zawkciang amate Egypt ngam ah khualhaw in, kumpipa kung a pai ciang Hadad sia leitang pawlkhat le inn khat pia hi, tuaciang anvaak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hadad sia kumpipa in pawl vawt a, kumpipa in a nuphal nu, Kumpinu Tahpenes ii suapuinu sia Hadad ii zi tu in pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua nu in Hadad taw tapa khat hing in, a min Genubath hi a, ama sia kumpinu in kumpi inn sungah khangsak a, kumpipa tapate taw teang khawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />David ii thina le ngalkaphonpi ukpa Joab ii thina thu Egypt ah Hadad in a zaak ciang Hadad in kumpipa munah, “Ka ngam ah hong cia kiksak ta'n,” ci in ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kumpipa in, “Banghangin maw? Kong piak tu khat po kong piak ngawl om ziam? Tua hu in cia kik nuam ni ziam?” ci in dongh hi. Hadad in, “Hong ciasak lel po ta'n,” ci in kumpipa tungah zo hi. Tuaciang a ngam ah ama ciakik hi. Edom kumpipa a hina taw ama sia Israel te atu a ngilo a ngal cipha khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pathian in Eliada ii tapa Rezon zongh Solomon a langpan tu in vawt hi. Rezon sia a topa Zobah kumpipa Hadadezer kung pan tai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />tuaciang ama sia thukham nei ngawl mihing tatsia pawlkhat ii lampui suak hi. (Hisia David ii Hadadezer a zaw zawk, a kipawlpui Syria te a thalup zawkciang ahi hi.) Rezon le a mite Damascus ah pai in tua munah teang uh hi, tua munah a mite in ama Syria kumpi suaksak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama sia Solomon khan sung Israel te ii ngal ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Solomon kumpi a langpan midang khat sia a uliante khat ahi Jeroboam hi a, Ephraim ngam Zeredah pan Nebat ii tapa hi. A nu sia meingong khat hi a Zeruah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hisia tualngal thawna taanghthu hi. Solomon sia Jerusalem ii nisuana sangah lei dimh in, khuapi luphungte pua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Solomon in Jeroboam sia a kiveakseak nasep hanciam khangno khat hi ci in a mu ciang Manasseh le Ephraim ngamsung om zawthawk thu taw a kisawl naseam theampo uksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ni khat ni in Jeroboam sia Jerusalem pan khualhaw in a pai laitak ama nguak hong pai Shiloh pan kamsaang pa Ahijah taw, ngam taanzauna khat lampi tungah kisi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahijah in a puantual thak silh lai sia suutin, khen sawm le khen nii sua in eautham hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />tuaciang, Jeroboam munah, “Puanbek sawm nangma la in, banghang ziam cile Topa , Israel ii Pathian in nangma tungah, ‘Keima in Solomon khut sung pan kumpi ngam ka la tu a, nang sia mi nam sawm hong pia tu khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ka naseampa David le Israel ngam bup sung pan ka khuapi tu ka tealsa Jerusalem ka khualna in, Solomon in nam khat keam lai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hi bangin seam tu khi hi, banghang ziam cile Solomon in kei hong nial in ngamdang pathiante: Sidon te ii numeipathian Astarte;, Moab te ii pathian Chemosh; Ammon te ii pathian Molech te bia hi. Solomon in ka thu hong ni ngawl hi; ama in khialna vawt zo hi, a pa David ii a zui bangin ka thukhamte le ka thupiakte zui ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ahihang Solomon tung pan kumpi ngam bup la ngawl tu khi hi, a nuntak lai teng vaang nei in ka koi tu hi. Ka teal pa, ka thukhamte le ka thupiakte hong zui ka naseampa David ii hu in hi bangin vawt tu khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Solomon ii tapa tung pan kumpi ngam laaksak in no minam sawmte hong pia tu khi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />ahihang Solomon ii tapa in nam khat ka keamsak tu hi, tuasia ciang ka naseampa David ii suan khat in kei hong kibiakna munin ka tealsa khuapi, Jerusalem panin a uk tawntung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Jeroboam awng, nang sia Israel kumpipa hong suaksak tu khi hi, tuaciang ngam na dei zaza na uk tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />ka thu a cing takin nong ni a, ka thukhamte taw nungta in, ka thupiak sia David ii hong nit bangin nong ni le nang taw kong omkhawm tawntung tu hi. Israel kumpipa kong suaksak tu a na suan le na paalte in nang zawkciang, David a tu ka vawt bangma in, ka uksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Solomon ii mawna hu in David ii suan le paalte daan ka pia tu hi, ahihang a tawntung hi ngawl tu hi, hong ci hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tua ahikom Solomon in Jeroboam thalup tu in hanciam ahihang Egypt kumpipa Shishak bealh in tua munah Solomon ii thi dong om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Solomon ii sep le vawt dang teng theampo, a nuntak sung a sepna le a ciimna teng Solomon ii Taanghthu sungah kikhum siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ama in Jerusalem ah Israel bup uk in kum 40 kumpi seam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ama thi a, David Khuapi sungah kiphum hi, tuaciang a tapa Rehoboam in ama ii kumpi za laih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Rehoboam sia Shechem ah pai a, tua munah Israel saksang mite theampo in ama kumpi suaksak tu in kikhawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Solomon kumpipa khut sung pan suakta tu in Egypt ngam ah a tai Nebat ii tapa Jeroboam in hi thu za a, Egypt ngam panin ama cia kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Saksang namte sung pan mite in ama samsak hi, tua zawkciang amate theampo Rehoboam kungah pai in ama tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Na pa Solomon in ko hong siat vawt a, vanhngit pi hong suan hi. Hi vanhngitte nong zaangsak a, nuntakna a ol zawhiat tu in nong vawt le ko sia a thumaan na uk sung mite hi tu khu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Ni thum zawkciang hong pai kik tavun, hong zo kik tu khi hi,” ci in ama in zo hi. Tua ahikom amate in nusia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kumpipa Rehoboam in a pa Solomon ii thudok uhaamzawte dongh hi. Ama in, “Hi mite tungah bangbangin zo tu khi ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in, “Hi mite atu a pha in a na na sepsak nuam le amate ii hong ngetnate tungtaang ah zawp in, tua hile amate in thumaan takin nang na hong sepsak tawntung tu hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahihang ama in uhaamzawte ii ngaisut piakna sia melsia a, ama taw a khangkhawm, tu in a thudokin a koi khangmoite kungah pai zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in, “Ka ngamtat natu in bangbangin ngaisutna hong pia tu nu ziam? A vanhngit uh zaangsak zaw tu in hong ngen mite tungah bangbangin ci tu khi ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in, “Amate tungah hi bangin ci in: ‘Ka khutme nobel sia ka pa kawng sangin lian zaw hi!’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate tungah, ‘Ka pa in no, vanhngit hong suan hi; keima in tua sangin ngitsak zaw lai tu khi hi. Ama in khauhual kibul ciang taw hong saat hi; kei ka hi le siphu saatna taw hong vel tu khi hi va ci ta'n!’ ” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ni thum zawkciang Jeroboam le mipite theampo Kumpipa Rehoboam kungah ama ii sawl bangin hong heak kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kumpipa in uhaamzawte ii ngaisutna piakte melsia in tua mite tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />khangmoite ii ngaisut piak bangin aw ham taw pau hi. Ama in, “Ka pa in no vanhngit hong suan hi; tuate sangin a ngit zaw lai in ka vawt tu hi. Ama in khauhual kibul ciang taw hong saat hi; kei ka hile siphu velna taw kong vel tu hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Shiloh panin kamsaang Ahijah tungtawn a, Nebat tapa Jeroboam tungah a sonsa, Topa ii deina sia a taangtun natu in a pau ahi hi. Hisia hu in kumpipa in mipite bangma thudon ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mipite in kumpipa ii a thudon ngawl a mu uh ciang in amate au hi. David le a innkuante kiamsuk tahen! Ei atu amate in bang hong vawtsak ngei na ziam? Israel mite awng, cia lel tawng! Rehoboam sia ama le ama kikeam tahen!” ci uh hi. Tua ahikom Israel mite tualngal tho a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Rehoboam sia Judah ngam khen sungah a teang mite bek ii kumpipa tu in nusia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Kumpipa Rehoboam in zawthawk thu taw a kisawl naseamte a uk Adoniram samin Israel te kungah paisak hi, ahihang amate in Adoniram suang taw deanglum uh hi. Tuasia ciang Rehoboam sia a siphu ngalleang tungah manlang takin kaato a, Jerusalem khua ah suakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua hun pan kipan Israel saksang kumpi ngammite in David ii kumpi nam sia leedo tan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Israel mite in Jeroboam sia Egypt pan hong ciakik zo ci in a zaak uh ciang, amate in mipite kikhopna khat ah sam in, Israel kumpipa suaksak hi. Judah nam bek David ii suan le paalte tungah thumaan lai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Rehoboam sia Jerusalem khua a thet ciangin ama in Judah nam le Benjamin namte sung pan ngalkap phabel 180,000 sam hi. Ama in saksang Israel namte simin uk kik sawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahihang Pathian in kamsaang pa Shemaiah kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Rehoboam, Judah le Benjamin namte theampo tungah hi thu puakin sawl hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Na suapui tilteal ahi Israel mite sim heak vun. Na vekpi inn ah cia kik vun. Thu piang sa sia keima ii deina hi,” cisak hi. Amate in Topa ii thupiakna mang siat in inn ah cia kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Israel kumpipa Jeroboam in Ephraim mualtung ngam ah Shechem khua kulh taw uumin tua munah tawmvei teang hi. Tua zawkciang ama in tua mun nusia in Penuel khua ah kulh vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama le ama hi bangin kici hi, “Tu a thu omzia bangin ka mite Jerusalem khua ah pai in Topa atu sangaw biakpiaknate tua mun Biakinnpi sungah vawt thong le amate in Judah kumpipa Rehoboam panpui leleau tu a, kei hong that tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Khua a ngai susut zawkciang ama in khamh khuital no nii ii lim vawtin a mite tungah, “Biakna vawt tu in Jerusalem ah na pai zawk uh ngei zo hi. Israel mite awng, hi sungah Egypt pan hong pusuasak na pathiante om hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama in a khamh khuital note khat Bethel ah koi a, khat sia Dan ah koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuabangin mipite in biakpiakna pia tu in Bethel le Dan ah a pai hu in maw uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jeroboam in mualdawnte ah biak natu munte zongh vawtin, Levi nam ahi ngawl innkuante sung panin thiampite teal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Judah poaipi taw kibangin Jeroboam in biakna poaipi khat zongh tha liat tha, ni sawm le ni nga ni in phuan hi. Ama in Bethel biaknatau tungah a khamh khuitalno a vawtte a tu in biakpiaknate pia a, ama saksa Bethel biakna tu munte ah a seam tu in thiampite koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuaciang tha liatna ni sawm le ni nga ni, ama ii see ni in, ama Bethel ah pai a. Israel te atu ama ii phot tawm poai khaamsak in biaknatau tungah sangaw biakpiakna khat pia hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa ii sawlna taw Judah panin kamsaang khat Bethel ah hong pai a, sangaw biakpiakna pia tu in Jeroboam biaknatau mai ah hong din laitak hong theng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa ii sawlna zui in kamsaangpa in biaknatau sia siat son hi: “Oh biaknatau, biaknatau awng, hisia Topa ii pauna hi: David ii bangkua sungah Josiah a kici nausen khat hong piang tu hi. Ama in doai biaknataute tungah seam in nang tungah sangaw biakpiakna a vawt thiampite nangma tungah that tu a, mihing ngute nang tungah hal tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaciang kamsaang pa in a ci lai na pan, “Hi biaknatau sia cimhtham tu a, a tungah vutte kithezau tu hi. Tuasia ciang Pathian in kei tungtawn a hong pau zo hi ci in na he tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kumpipa Jeroboam in hi thu a zaak ciang ama kawkin thupia hi: “Pasal ziasia man vun!” Thakhat thu in kumpipa ii baan zaw a, dok kik thei nawn ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thakhat thu in biaknatau sia cimhtham a, Topa min taw kamsaang pa ii sonkhol bangma in vutte lei ah kithezau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kumpipa Jeroboam in kamsaangpa munah, “Ka khut hong damsak natu in Topa na Pathian tungah nong hesuak na in thu hong ngetsak ta'n!” ci hi. Kamsaang pa in Topa tungah thu a nget le kumpipa baan dam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuasia ciang kumpipa in kamsaangpa munah, “Kei taw cia khawm in bang khat po ne tawng. Na sepsa te hu in thaman hong pia tu khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kamsaangpa in, “Na hauna a lang keak nong pia hial tu ahizong nang taw paikhawm ngawl tu khi hi, ahibuale zong nang taw bangma ne ngawl dawn ngawl tu khi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa in bangma ne ngawl dawn ngawl tu in thu hong pia a, kong paina lampi tawnin a ciakik ngawl tu in hong sawl hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahikom ama in a paina lampi pan ciakik ngawlin lampi dang khat tawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua hun laitakin Bethel ah a teang kamsaang pasal huai khat om hi. A tapate hong pai a Judah pan a kamsaang khat ii Bethel ah a ngamtatna teng le Jeroboam kumpipa tungah a pauna teng ama munah son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“A heakkik ciangin koisung tawn ziam” ci in kamsaang huaipa in amate dongh hi. Amate in a lampi lak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tuaciang amate in a laa kungh thuasak in sawl hi. Amate in a sawl bang a vawt zawk uh ciang ama sia laa tungah to in pai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Judah panin kamsaang pa ii nung pan a zui le oak thingkung nuai khat ah a to mu hi. “Nang Judah pan a kamsaangpa na hi ziam?” ci in dongh hi. “Hi khi hi,” ci in pasalpa in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in, “Inn ah cia in, kei taw an nekhawm tawng,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahihang Judah panin kamsaangpa in “Nang taw cia khawmin nong zindo nopna hong saang zo ngawl tu khi hi, tuaciang hilai ah nang taw bangma nekhawm ngawl tu khi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />banghang ziam cile Topa in bangma ka neak ka dawn ngawl natu le ka paina lam tawnin ka cia kik ngawl natu thu hong pia hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Bethel pan kamsaang huai pa in ama munah, “Kei zongh nangma bangma kamsaang khat khi hi, tuaciang Topa ii sawlna taw vantunglalang khat in nang sia inn ah ciapui in zindo in hong sawl hi,” ci hi. Ahihang kamsaang huai pa sia leilot thu son ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ahikom Judah pan kamsaangpa sia kamsaang huaipa taw ciakhawm in ama taw an nekhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sabuai ah an ne in a to laitak Topa kammal sia kamsaang huai pa tungah hong theng hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />tuaciang ama in tua Judah kamsaang pa tungah, “ Topa in ama ii thu ni ngawlin, a thupiak bang seam ngawl hi hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua taangin na heakkik a, an ne ngawl a hong sawlna munah tumin an na ne hi. Hi sia hangin nang sia thalup na thuak tu a, na luang sia na innkuan thaan ah kivui ngawl tu hi,” ci in au hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Anneak zawkciang kamsaang huai pa in Judah pan kamsaangpa atu a laa kungh thuasak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />ama sia laa tungah tosak hi. Lampi ah tawpi khat taw kisi a, tawpi in ama thatlum hi. A luang sia lampi tungah kisial a, a laa le tawpi te sia a luang hui ah ding uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mihing pawlkhat in tua mun hong kaantan a, lampi tungah a luang mu uh hi, tawpi sia a kungah dingin om hi. Amate sia Bethel ah paisuak in, amate ii mu teng son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kamsaang huai pa in tua thu a zaak ciang, ama in, “Tuasia Topa ii thupiakna a ni ngawl kamsaang pa hi! Tua ahikom Topa in ama a that tu in tawpi paisak hi, Topa ii ka vawt tu a ci bangma in kivawt hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuasia zawkciang a tapate munah, “Ka laa kungh hong thuasak tavun,” ci hi. Amate in tuabangin seam uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />tuaciang ama laa tungah to in a pai le kamsaang pa ii luang lampi ah kisial in mu hi, laa le tawpi zongh a kungah dingkhawm nginge lai hi. Tawpi in mithi luang le ne ngawl a, laa zongh bangma law ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua tungtangin a khuangai natu le a phum natu in kamsaang huai pa in a luang phaam a, laa tungah suanin Bethel ah ciapui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ama in a innkuan thaan ah phum a, tuaciang ama le a tapate khuangai in, “Oh, ka suapui, ka suapui awng!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A phum zawk uh ciang, kamsaangpa in a tapate munah, “Ka thi ciangin hi thaan sungah ama ii luang hui ah hong phum tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Topa ii thupiakna taw Bethel ah biaknatau le Samaria khuate sungah a biakna munte langpanin a pau teng sia tung takpi tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Israel kumpipa Jeroboam in ama tatsiatnate kheal tuan ngawl a, ama saksa biaknataute ah thiampi seam tute sia bangkua thawthongte panin teal lai hi. Ama in thiampi a uuk pawpo thiampi in koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hi mawna in siatna le ama ii kinguizui kumpi ukna a bo cimitna suak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua hun laitakin Kumpipa Jeroboam ii tapa Abijah a ciina hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jeroboam in a zi munah, “Nangma le nangma, kuama ii hong tel ngawl natu in kimealseal in a, kei sia Israel kumpipa suak tu hong ci, Shiloh a teang kamsaangpa Ahijah kungah va pai ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Anluum luum sawm, moh pawlkhat le khuaitui thawl khat va puak ta'n. Ih tapa bang suak tu ziam ama munah dongh ta'n, hong son tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ahikom ama Shiloh khua Ahijah inn ah pai hi. Khanghaam zo ahikom Ahijah sia a mittaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A tapa ciina sia huvau dongh tu in Jeroboam ii zi sia ama kungah a pai tu hunlam Topa in son zo hi. Tuaciang Topa in Ahijah ii pau natu teng hil zo hi. Jeroboam ii zi hong thet ciangin, ama sia ngualdang khat bangin hong kivawt tawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahihang Ahijah in ama ii bangkua sung sangah hong tum a zaak ciang, “Hong tum ta'n, Jeroboam ii zi na hi sia hong he khi hi. Midang khat bangin banghangin kithoai ni ziam? Nang atu thupha ngawl kong son tu nei khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pai in a Jeroboam munah va son ta'n, Israel ii Pathian Topa in ama tungah hi bangin ci hi: ‘Mite sung pan nang kong teal a, ka Israel mite uk pa in kong koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />David suan le paalte khut sung panin kumpi ngam ka lakeak a, nang kong pia hi. Ahihang nang sia ka naseampa David bang na hi bua hi, ama sia kei tungah hong thumaan tinten a, ka thupiakte ni in, ka thukim teng bek seam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nang in na mai a ngamukte sangin mawna lianzawte na vawt hi. Nang in kei nong nial a, tuaciang ka thin uuk natu in milimte vawtin thik milimte na biak tu in na vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hi sia hu in na kumpi khang zui in tuasiatna kong tungsak tu a, tuaciang na suan na paal sung panin pa a minpiang a moi a haam a kibangin ka thatlum siat tu hi. Na bangkua kong heam tu a; eak bangin kiphiat keak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khuapi sungah a thi na innkuanpuite sa sia ui in ne tu a, ngam taanzauna a thite sa sia vaciik in ne tu hi. Keima, Topa in pau zo khi hi,’ ” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaciang Ahijah in Jeroboam ii zi tungah a ci lai na pan, “Tu in inn ah cia ta'n. Khua sung na tum po ciangin na tapa thi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel mi bup in ama atu khuangaina lakin phum tu hi. Jeroboam bangkua sung pan ama bekma pha takin kivui tu hi, banghang ziam cile ama ii tung bekma ah Israel ii Pathian Topa lungkim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa in Israel te tungah kumpi khat koi tu a, ama in Jeroboam ii kumpi khangngui sia bosak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa in Israel daan pia tu a, tuaciang lui sungah pumpate bangin ngawk tu hi. A taanghpupite tungah a piaksa hi leitang phate tung panin ama in Israel mite zunglok tu a, Euphrates ngun kalhin thethaang tu hi, banghang ziam cile amate in Asherah numeipathian sia ii limte a vawt hu in ama a thin uuksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa in Israel taisan tu hi banghang ziam cile Jeroboam in mawna vawt a, Israel mite mawna sungah lampui hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jeroboam ii zi sia Tirzah ah ciakik hi. A inn sung a tum bek lian ciangin a tapa thi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A naseam pa, kamsaangpa Ahijah tungah Topa ii sonkhol bangma in Israel mite ama atu khuangai in phum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jeroboam ii sep le vawt a dang theampo, a ngal dona ahizong a uk zia ahizong Israel kumpite ii Taanghthu sungah kikhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jeroboam in kum 22 sung kumpi in maang hi. Ama thi in kiphum a, a tapa Nadab in a kumpi za laih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Solomon ii tapa Rehoboam sia Judah kumpipa a sua lai in, kum 41 pha hi, tuaciang Israel ngam bup sungah Topa a kibiak natu mun Topa ii tealsa Jerusalem khuapi pan kum sawm le kum sali uk hi. Rehoboam ii nu sia Ammon panin Naamah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Judah mite in Topa tungah maw a, ama thin uuk natu in a taanghpupite theampo ii vawt sangin a tamzaw in vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amate in pathian theamte biak natu in biakna munte vawt a, mualtung le thinglim nuaite ah biak tu in Asherah limte le suangkhuamte phut uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A siatbelna sia, tua doai biakna munte ah numeite le pasalte sia pumpi zuakin om uh hi. Israel mite ii tua ngamsung a zot uh lai in Topa ii a nawkeak mite ii a maizumhuai ngamtatnate ma Judah mite in ngamtatna in nei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Rehoboam ii uk zawk a kum ngana ciangin Egypt kumpipa Shishak in Jerusalem sim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama in Biakinnpi sung le kumpi inn sung a sumngum theampo la siat hi, tuate sungah Solomon ii vawt sa khamh lumte zongh kihel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuate taangin Kumpipa Rehoboam in taau lumte vawt a, kumpi inn kongkhacing uliante tungah a kepcing tu in aap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kumpipa Biakinnpi ah a pai simin a cingte in tua lumte paipui in, tua zawkciang a cingte omna inndoi ah ciapui kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kumpipa Rehoboam ii sep le vawt dangte theampo sia Judah Kumpite Taanghthu sungah kikhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hi hunte theampo sungah Rehoboam le Jeroboam sia a tawntungin khat le khat kido uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Rehoboam thi a, David Khuapi sung kumpi thaan ah kiphumin, a tapa Abijah in a kumpi za laih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel kumpipa Jeroboam ii maan zawk a kum sawm le liatna ciangin Abijah sia Judah kumpipa suak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tuaciang, ama in Jerusalem panin kum thum sung uk hi. Ama ii nu sia Absalom ii tanu Maacah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in a pa ii a vawt mawnate ma vawtin, a pu selawn David bangin Topa a Pathian tungah thumaan siat zo ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahihang David hangin Topa a Pathian in ama zawkciang Jerusalem a uk tu le Jerusalem ngammuangsak tu in Abijah sia tapa khat pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in hi bangin a vawt sia banghang ziam cile David in ama ii lungkimte bek seam a, Hit mi Uriah taw a vai khat simngawl po, a thukham peuma zui ngawl nei ngeingawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Abijah ii khan hunsung theampo ma Rehoboam le Jeroboam ii hun pan a kipan kidona sia kizom suak lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaciangin Abijah ii sep le vawt dangte theampo sia Judah Kumpipate Taanghthu sungah kikhum siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Abijah thi in David Khuapi sungah kiphum hi, tuaciang a tapa Asa in ama kumpi za laih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel kumpipa Jeroboam ii maan zawk a kum kul na ciangin Asa sia Judah kumpipa suak hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tuaciangin ama in Jerusalem ah kum 41 sung uk hi. A pi sia Absalom ii tanu Maacah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A taanghpupi David ii ngamtat bangin Asa in Topa lungkim tu in ngamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in ngamsung panin numei le pasal pumpi zuak a, doai biakna munte ah a om theampo hawlkhia hi, tuaciang ama ii mai ah a seamte ii vawt milim theampo heam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in a pi Maacah sia, kumpinu ii nu a hina panin heam hi, banghang ziam cile ama in ta tam nei natu a siam Asherah numeipathian ii a kiihuai milim khat vawt hi. Asa in tua milim sia sattan in Kidron kuam ah hal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Asa in doai biakna mun theampo susia ngawl ahihang Topa tungah a nuntak tawntung thumaan top hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Biakinnpi sungah a pa ii Pathian atu a piaktuam na teng le khamh le ngunn taw a kivawt ama ii piaktuam nate zongh koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Asa le Israel kumpipa Baasha sia vaang a nei uh lai teng in kido tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Baasha in Judah sim a, Judah ngam pan a pusuak a sungtang thei te theampo a khatan natu in Ramah sia kulh taw uum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ahikom Kumpipa Asa in Biakinnpi le kumpi inn sung a khamh le ngunn a om laiteng la in Damascus ah, Tabrimmon ii tapa, Hezion tupa, Syria kumpipa Benhadad kungah a uliante pawl khat in puaksak a, hi bang kam teng taw thaak hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Ih pate sia ngal a kipawl ahi bangma ei zongh kipawl khawm tawng. Hi ngunn le khamhte sia nangma atu letsong kong piak hi. Tu in ka ngamsung pan a ngalkapte a laak kik nanak natu in, Israel kumpipa Baasha taw na kipawl na sia na pheltan in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Benhadad kumpipa in Asa ii ci teng thukim a, Israel khuapite sim tu in ngalkap ukte le ngalkaphonpite kuansak hi. Amate in Ijon, Dan, Abel Beth Maacah, Galilee Tuili hui ngam teng, Naphtali ngam bup la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kumpipa Baasha in thupiang teng a zaak ciang Ramah khua ah a kulhpi vawt teng tawpin Tirzah zuan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Kumpipa Asa in Judah ngam bup ah khat zongh kikhe ngawlin, Baasha ii kulh vawtna a zak suang le thingte Ramah panin puasiat tu in thupia hi. Asa in Mizpah le Benjamin ngam ah Geba khuapi sia hi vanhte taw ngalnanna kulh in vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Asa ii a sep a vawt dang theampo, a hanna le kulh a vawt khuate ii thu teng Judah Kumpipate ii Taanghthu sungah kikhum hi. Ahihang a khanhaam ciangin ama sia peang natna taw zawcip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Asa thi a, David Khuapi sung kumpi thaan ah kiphum hi, tuaciang a tapa Jehoshaphat in a kumpi za laih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Asa ii maan zawk a kum niina hun sungah Kumpipa Jeroboam ii tapa Nadab sia Israel kumpipa hong suak a kum nii sung uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama ii mai ah a pa bangma in Topa tungah ama maw a, Israel te mawna sungah lampui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Issachar nam Ahijah ii tapa Baasha in Nadab thasawm in, Nadab le a ngalkaphonpi in Philistia ngam Gibbethon khuapi a uumci laitakin ama thatlum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hi thu sia Kumpipa Asa ii Judah ah a maan zawk a kum thumna sungah piang hi. Tua bangin, Baasha in Nadab ii Israel kumpi za laih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thakhat thu in ama in Jeroboam ii innkuanpuite that siat hi, Shiloh pan kamsaang pa Ahijah ii Topa kammal a sonsa bang tatakin Jeroboam ii innkuanpui teng that siat a; khat zongh khe ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hi bang a pian sia banghang ziam cile Jeroboam in Israel ii Pathian Topa sia ama mawna hang le Israel mite mawna a vawtsak hu in thin uuksak ahi hang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Nadab ii a sep a vawt dang theampo sia Israel Kumpite ii Taanghthu sungah kikhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Asa le Israel kumpipa Baasha te ngeal sia a vaang nei uh lai teng khat le khat kido tan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Asa ii maan zawk a kum thumna ah Ahijah ii tapa Baasha sia Israel kumpipa suak a, Tirzah panin kum 24 sung uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ama ii mai ah Kumpipa Jeroboam bangma in Topa tungah ama maw a, Israel te mawna sungah lampui hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hanani ii tapa kamsaang pa Jehu tungah Baasha atu kam hi teng Topa in pau hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Nang sia bangma ahi ngawl khat hi napi ka Israel mite lampui in hong koi khi hi. Tuaciang tu in nang zongh Jeroboam bangma in mawna na vawt a, ka mite mawna sungah lampui zo ni hi. Amate ii mawnate in kei hong thin uuksak hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tua ahikom Jeroboam ka vawt bangma in nang le na bangkua kong heam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na innkuanpuite khuapi sungah a thi peuma ui in ne tu a, ngam taanzauna sungah a thi peuma vaciik in ne tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Baasha ii a sep a vawt dang theampo Israel Kumpipate Taanghthu sungah kikhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Baasha thi a Tirzah ah kiphum hi, tuaciang a tapa Elah in a kumpi za laih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Baasha le a bangkua langpanna, tua Topa kammalte sia kamsaangpa Jehu in pia hi, banghang ziam cile Baasha in Topa tungah mawna vawt hi. Ama in Topa thin uuksak hi, banghang ziam cile ama in tatkhakna sia ama mai a, Jeroboam vawt bangin a vawt dom ngawlin, Jeroboam ii innkuanpuite theampo zongh that siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Asa ii maan zawk a kum 26 na in, Baasha ii tapa Elah sia Israel kumpipa suakin Tirzah pan kum nii sung uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A uliante khat, kumpipa siphu ngalleangte ii kimkhen khat a ukpa Zimri in ama suam sawm hi. Ni khat ni in Tirzah ah Elah sia kumpi inn ukpa Arza ii inn ah zu kham hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zimri sia inn sungah tum a, Elah suamlum in kumpi za laih hi. Hi bang a pian hun sia Judah kumpipa Asa a maan zawk kum 27 na kum ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zimri kumpi a sua po ciangin Baasha ii innkuanpuite theampo thatlum siat hi. A mealheak le a lawm ahi theampo pasal a minpiang thatlumsak siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuabangin kamsaangpa Jehu tungtawnin Topa ii Baasha huvau a son bang tatakin Zimri in Baasha innkuanpui theampo thatlum siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate ii milim a biak hu le Israel mite mawna sung a thet pui hu in Baasha le a tapa Elah in Israel ii Pathian, Topa a thin uuksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Elah ii sep le vawt a dangte theampo Israel Kumpipate Taanghthu sungah kikhum siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Asa maan zawk kum 27 na ciang Zimri in Tirzah pan Israel sia ni sali sung uk hi. Israel ngalkapte in Philistia ngam Gibbethon khuapi uumci uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tuaciang amate in Zimri ii kumpipa a suamlup a zaak uh ciang, tua hun tua munah amate ngalkap ukpa Omri sia Israel kumpipa in thangsak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Omri le a ngalkapte in Gibbethon nusia in Tirzah ah pai a uumci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zimri in khuapi sia kila zo ci in a mu ciang kumpi inn ii a sungsang kulh ah tumin kumpi inn hal a, ama zongh meikuang sungah thi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hi bangin a pian sia ama in Topa tungah a maw hang hi. Ama mai ah a maang Jeroboam bangma in ama mawna hu le Israel mite mawna sungah a lampui hu in, Topa lungkim ngawlna piang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zimri ii a sep a vawt dangte theampo a sawmna thu zongh Israel Kumpipate Taanghthu sungah kikhum siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel mite sia kikhen hi: pawlkhat te in Ginath ii tapa Tibni kumpi suaksak nuam a, a dangte in Omri dei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A khakbel ciang Omri deite in zo zaw hi; Tibri thi a, Omri sia kumpi suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuabangin Judah kumpipa Asa maan zawk a kum 31 na kumin Omri sia Israel kumpipa suak hi, tuaciang ama in kum sawm le kum nii sung uk hi. A masa kum luk teng sia ama in Tirzah pan uk a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />tua zawkciang Samaria ngam mual khat sia Shemer a kici pasal khat ii tung pan ngunntang 6,000 taw lei hi. Omri in tua mual sia kulh vawt in tua munah khua khat saat a, a min sia mual nei lui pa min Shemer la in Samaria phuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Omri in ama mai a te sangin Topa tungah a nasia zawin maw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama ii mai ah Jeroboam bangma in ama mawna te hu le a mite sia mawna le milim biakna sungah a thet pui hu in Israel ii Pathian Topa thin uukna piangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Omri ii a sep a vawt dangte le ama zawnate sia Israel Kumpipate Taanghthu sungah kikhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Omri thi a, Samaria ah kiphumin, a tapa Ahab in a kumpi za laih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Asa ii maan zawk a kum 38 na kumin Omri ii tapa Ahab sia Israel kumpipa suak a, Samaria ah kum 22 sung uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ama in ama ii mai a kumpi dangte sangin Topa tungah mawna tam vawtzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama atu in Kumpipa Jeroboam bangin a maw tu sia pha zo sa ngawl hi; ama in tua kaanin ngamta a, Jezebel a kici Sidon kumpipa Ethbaal ii tanu teenpui in Baal pathian bia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ama in Samaria ah Baal atu biakinn saksakin, biaknatau khat vawtin biakinn sungah koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ama in numeipathian Asherah milim khat zongh vawt hi. Israel ii Pathian Topa thin uuk natu in ama ii masia a, Israel kumpi theampo sangin ama in vawt zaw lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ama ii maan sungin Bethel panin Hiel in Jericho sa kik hi. Nun ii tapa Joshua tungah Topa ii sonkhol bangma in Hiel in a tapa lianbel Abiram sia Jericho khua ii tawdap a vawt laitakin thi sua a, tuaciang a tapa a nobel Segub zong kongpite a vawt ciang thisua hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Gilead ngam Tishbe panin Elijah a kici kamsaangpa in Ahab kumpipa munah, “A na ka sepsak Israel te ii a nungta Pathian, Topa min taw keima in nang tungah kong sonna pan keima ii kong son kik mateng kum nii ahibuale kum thum sung daaitui ahizong, nguatui ahizong hang tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Topa in Elijah munah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Hi mun nusia in a, nisuana sangah pai in Cherith luino hui ah buu ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua luino in na zak tu tui hong sik tu a, tuaciang va-akte in nangma tua munah an hong puak tu in thupia zo khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Elijah in Topa ii thupiakna zui in, Cherith luino ah pai in tua munah taam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in Luitui dawnin, va-akte in zing sim nitak simin anluum le sa puak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tawm vei zawkciang nguatui kisap hu in lui sia kang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Topa in Elijah munah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tu in Sidon nai ah a om Zarephath khua ah pai in a, tua munah om ta'n. Tua munah meingong nupi khat nang an hong vaak tu in thupia zo khi hi” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahikom Elijah sia Zarephath ah pai a, khua kongpi a thet ciang, meingongnu khat thingtom in om mu hi. Ama in, “Tui neak khat hong puak ta'n,” tua nu tungah ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tui laksak tu in a pai ciang, “Nong hesuakna in anluum zongh hong paipui ta'n,” ci thua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in, “Anluum nei ngawl het khi hi ci in a nungta Topa na Pathian min taw ka kiciam ngam hi. Ka nei theampo sia kuang sungah anvui khut hum khat le thawl sungah olive thau tawmcik bek hi. Hi sungah kong pai sia thing tawm tom a ciapui in, ka nei sun teng ka tapa le keima neak tu in vawt tu khi hi. Tuasia koma an neak khakbel hi tu a, tua zawkciang pukthi tu khu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Elijah in, “Thintoi heak in, va pai ta'n a, an na vawt ta'n. Ahihang a masa phitin na nei sung pan kei atu anluumno khat hong vawtsak ta'n a, kei hong puak ta'n, tua zawkciang nang le na tapa atu a om lai teng vawt in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile hisia sia Topa, Israel te ii Pathian ii pauna hi: ‘Kuang sungah anvui thot ngeingawl tu a, thawl sungah sathau sia, keima Topa ii nguatui ka puak ni mateng kang ngeingawl tu hi,’ ” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Meingong nu in Elijah sawl bangin pai in ngamta a, tuaciang amate in ni tam mama sung a khom tu an nei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa ii Elijah tungtawn a kamciam a piak bangin, kuang sungah anvuite thot ngawlin, thawl sungah sathau a kang bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua zawk tawmvei ciangin meingong nu ii tapa a ci na hi; ama zawm vaial in a khakbel ciang thi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in Elijah munah, “Pathian mipa awng, banghangin hi bangin kei hong vawt ni ziam? Hi sungah nong pai sia ka mawna teng Pathian in phawksak a, ka tapa thi natu in hong vawt ni ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Elijah in, “Patang sia keima hong pia ta'n,” ci hi. Ama in patang sia a khut sung pan la a, ama ii omna inn tung inndoi ah toai to in, lupna tungah sial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua zawkciang nging takin thungen a, “Oh, Topa ka Pathian awng, banghangin hi bang meingongnu tungah a lauhuai mama in vawt ni ziam? Ama dik a kei hong vaak kasap tu in a tapa thalupsak ni hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Elijah in patang sia tungah thumvei bokin kizalh a, “Oh, Topa ka Pathian awng, hi patang a nuntakna pia kik in!” ci in thungen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa in Elijah ii thungetna zo a; patang sia a hu hong sang kikin hong nungta kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Elijah in patangpa sia inn nuaidawl a nu kungah paipui suk kikin a nu munah, “En in, na tapa nungta hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in, “Tu ahile nang sia Pathian ii mi khat hi a, tuaciang Topa in nang tungtawnin hong pau takpi hi, ci in hong he khi hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nguatui a hanh zawk kum thum a phak zawk hiat ciangin Topa in Elijah munah, “Va pai ta'n a, Kumpipa Ahab mai ah kilak ta'n, tuaciang ngua kong zusak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ahikom Elijah hong kipan hi. Samaria a kialpi tung sia a nasia bel laitak ahi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tua ahikom Ahab in kumpi inn a uk pa Obadiah sam hi. (Obadiah sia Topa a bia thu um khat hi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jezebel in Topa ii kamsaangte a thalup lai in, Obadiah in tua kamsaangte zakhat la in, suanghawng sungah pawl khat ciang 50 veu khen in pawl nii in seal a, an le tui sik hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahab in Obadiah munah, “Ih siphute le laate a nungta in ih kep thei natu in lopa a kicing ih mu zo ziam maw, ngamsung tuinaak theampo le ngun omna theampo ah pai in zong sin tawng. Ih ngannote khat zongh ih thalup kul ngawl tha tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate ngamsung koisungsan ah akua pai in zong tu ziam ci in thukimna vawt a, mun tuatuam ah vaiding tek uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Obadiah in a paina lam tungah thakhat thu in Elijah taw kisi hi. Ama in tel a, ama ii mai ah a niamin kunsuk a, “Topa awng, nangma tatak ma ni ziam,” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in, “Hi khi hi, keima Elijah khi hi” ci in zo hi. “Pai in a, na topa, kumpipa munah hi sungah ka om hunlam va son ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Obadiah in, “Kumpipa Ahab ii hong thalup tu launa sungah nong koi natu in bang khialna nei khi ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A nungta Topa, na Pathian taw kiciam ngam khi hi, leitung ngam theampo ah kumpipa in nang hong zongsak zo hi. Ngam khat a ukpa in nang sia ama ii ngam sungah om ngawl hi ci in thu a puak le Ahab in tua ngam ah nang hong kimu zawk ngawlna thu sia tua ngamukpa kiciamsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaciang tu in nang hi sungah na om sia son tu in ama kungah pai le hong oai ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka pai po ciang Pathian ii thaa in nang sia heak ngeingawlna mundang khat pawpo ah hong tua luilam le bang law tu khi ziam? Tuasia ciang Ahab munah nang hi sungah om hi ka ci ciang, ama in hong mu zo buale kei hong thatlum tu hi. Ka no ciang a thu um, Topa a biapa ka hi hunlam sia ciamtee in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jezebel in Topa kamsaangte a thalup lai in amate suanghawng sungah 50 veu pawl nii sua in, zakhat ka seal a, an le tui ka vaakna thu za ngeingawl ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahikom bangbangin nang hi sungah na omna thu kumpipa kungah son tu in hong sawl thei ni ziam! Ama in kei hong that tu hi!” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Elijah in, “A na a seam keima in a nungta Topa taw kiciam khi hi, kumpipa mai ah tu ni kilak tu in kiciam khi hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahikom Obadiah in Ahab kumpipa kungah pai in a son ciang, Ahab sia Elijah taw kimu tu in vaiding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahab in a mu ciangin ama munah, “Zialai ah nang — Israel ngam sungah ngimna a nasiabel a piangsak pa om na hi ziam!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Kei ngimna a piangsak pa hi ngawl khi hi,” ci in Elijah in zo hi. “Nangma ni hi — nangma le na pa na hi uh hi. Nangma in Topa ii thupiakte zui ngawlin Baal milimte bia ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tu in Israel mite theampo kei taw Carmel mual ah kisi tu in thupia in. Baal kamsaang 450 le numeipathian Asherah kamsaang 400, kumpinu Jezebel ii a vaak teng hong paipui tavun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ahikom Ahab in Israel mite theampo le Baal kamsaangte sia Carmel Mual ah sam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Elijah in mite kungah paito in, “Na thin uh na khensat natu in bang tanvei hai lai tu nu ziam? Topa sia Pathian ahile ama bia vun; ahihang Baal sia Pathian ahile bia vun!” ci hi. Ahihang mite in kam khat zongh pau ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Elijah in, “ Topa kamsaang sia kei bekma taanglai khi hi, ahihang Baal kamsaangte sia 450 om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khuital nii hong paipui tavun; Baal kamsaangte in khat lasak vun a, tua sia ngoin, semneen in thingkangte tungah koisak vun — ahihang meitaw heak vun. Keima in khuital dang khat sia tuabang ma in ka vawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Baal kamsaangte in amate ii pathian tungah thu ngen hen, tuaciang keima in Topa tungah thu ka ngen tu a, tuaciang meikuang hong puakna taw thunget hong zo pa — ama sia Pathian hi,” ci hi. Mipite lungkim in au uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaciang Elijah in Baal kamsaangte munah, “No tam mama na hi uh ciang, noma khuital khat la in kinging khol masa vun. Noma pathian tungah thungen vun, ahizong thingkang te tungah meitaw heak vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amate kungah a kipaipui khuital sia amate in la a, a vawt tu bang vawtin nisun dong Baal tungah thu ngen uh hi. Amate in, “Hong zo ta'n, Baal awng!” ci in au a, amate ii a sak biaknatau sia ii kiimkot ah laam top uh hi. Ahihang zona hong pai bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Sun hun ciang Elijah in amate nunau tu hong kipan hi: “A nging zaw in thungen ve vun! Ama sia pathian khat hi! Ama mangngai in om ziam, awnghaw ziam, tua ahibuale khualhaw ziam khat hi thei tu hi! Tua ahibuale zong a mut laitak hi thei tu hi, na phok uh kul tu hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ahikom kamsaangte in nging zaw lai in thu hong ngen in, amate ii zeksa ngeina om bangin naamte, naamzumte taw amate le amate chisan a luan dongin ki at uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Sun ni kaai dongin amate au lialua in om top lai uh hi; ahihang zona hong pai ngawl a, aw khat zongh kiza ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Elijah in mipite munah, “Ka kung nai hong neak zaw tavun,” a ci ciang amate in ama kiimkot ah kikhawm uh hi. Topa biaknatau a kibaltham sia hong pua kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Israel ci in Topa ii Israel min a piakpa Jacob tate min a kivaw nam sawm le nam nii sim atu in suangtum sawm le nii la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hi suangte taw ama in Topa biak natu biaknatau sa kik hi. Ama in tua kiimkot ah tui litre 14 dektak a ta thei tu dum to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama in thingkangte biaknatau tungah koi in, khuital sia semneen a, thingkangte tungah koi hi. Ama in, “Tui pheal li hong dim tavun, a biakpiakna tung le thing tungah hong sung tavun,” ci hi. Amate in tuabang ma in vawt a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />tuaciang ama in, “Hi kik vun,” ci hi — amate in sung kik hi. Ama in, “Khatvei ma hi lai vun,” ci hi — tuaciang amate in tuabang ma seam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tui sia biaknatau kiim ah hong luang a, dum sung hong dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Nikai sang sangaw biakpiakna hun tak ciang Elijah in biaknatau neak in thungen hi. “Oh Topa , Abraham, Isaac le Jacob te ii Pathian awng, tu in nang Israel ii Pathian hi a, tuaciang kei sia na naseampa ka hina taw nong sawl bangin hi bang teng ngamta ka hina thu sia hong lak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Hong zo ta'n Topa , kei hong zo ta'n, tua hile hi mite in nang Topa Pathian hi a, tuaciang amate nang kungah heak kiksak tu ni hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Topa in meikuang hong puaksuk a, sangaw biakpiakna, thingkangte, suangtumte kaanghtham in, lei zongh kaangh upsak a, dum sungah tuite kosak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Mipite in hisia a mu uh ciang amate le amate lei ah hong bok suk a, “ Topa sia Pathian hi; Topa bekma Pathian hi!” ci in au uh hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Elijah in thupia a, “Baal kamsaangte man vun; kuama suaktasak heak vun!” ci hi. Mipite in amate man siat a, tuaciang Elijah in Kishon Ngun ah paipui sukin amate thatlum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Elijah in Kumpipa Ahab kungah, “Tu in va pai ta'n a, an va ne ta'n. Nguazu nuam kisa in a hawk bangza khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ahab an ne tu a pai laitakin Elijah sia Carmel Mualdawn ah kaato a, lei ah kun sukin, a khup sungah a lu phum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A naseampa munah, “Va pai ta'n a, tuipi sang va en ta'n,” ci hi. A naseampa pai a hong heak kik in, “Bangma mu bong,” ci hi. Salivei vaset Elijah in a naseampa pai in en a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />A sali veina ciangin ama hong heakkik a, “Meeikaai no khat mihing khut saang a lianzaw ngawl khat tuipi panin hong paito ka mu hi,” ci hi. Elijah in a naseampa thupia a, “Kumpipa Ahab kungah va pai ta'n a, ama siphu ngalleang sungah to in, ngua ii khaktan ma inn ah a ciakik natu va son ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Hun tawm no sungin van sia meeivom dim in, vui va a, ngua nasia takin zuk tu kipan hi. Ahab zongh siphu ngalleang sungah to in, Jezreel ah cia kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Topa ii thahatna Elijah tungah hong theng a; ama in a puante a kawng ah ngat takin sawmin, Jezreel a thet dong Ahab ii mai ah tai hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpipa Ahab in a zi Jezebel munah, Elijah ii ngamtatna theampo son a, Baal kamsaang theampo a thalup na thu teng son siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua nu in Elijah kam khat thaak hi: “Kamsaangte tungah na vawt bang keak in zing ciang tu hunin nang tungah kong vawt bua tale pathiante in kei hong vaatlum tahen,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Elijah lau a, a nuntakna kihuk natu in, a naseampa taw Judah ngam Beersheba zuan in tai hi. A naseampa tua munah nusia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Elijah sia nitangtum duisung ah a peangin pai hi. Ama in thinglim nuai khat ah tawlnga in to a, tuaciang thithei le uuk hi. “Nasia leih hi, Topa awng, ka nuntakna hong laaksak ta'n; thi leng zong phazaw tu hi,” ci in thungen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in thingkung nuai ah lumin mu hi. Thakhat thu in vantunglalang khat in tham a, tuaciang, “Tho in a ne in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A kiimkot a et ciang a luthung ah anluum khat le tuidam thawl khat mu hi. Ama in tuate ne a, tua zawkciang lum kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa ii vantunglalang heakkik in a nii veina in phong a, “Tho in a, an ne in, tua ahibuale na khualhaw natu sia nang atu haksa lei tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Elijah tho in a neak ciang tua an in ni 40 sung mual thiangtho Sinai dong a pai khom natu thangui thatang nguan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua munah zan ngiak tu in suanghawng khat ii sungah tum hi. Thakhat thu in Topa in, “Elijah, hi sungah bang vawt ni ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in, “ Topa Pathian Vaanglianbelpa awng, nangma ii na — nangma bekma ii na hong sepsak tawntung khi hi. Ahihang Israel mite in nang taw a thuciamna paltan in, na biaknataute baltham a, na kamsaangte thatlum siat hi. Keima bekma taanglai khi hi — tuaciang amate in kei hong that nuam in hanciam uh hi!” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in ama tungah “Pusuak in a, mualdawn keima mai ah hong ding ta'n,” ci hi. Tua zawkciang Topa in kaantan a, vuipi nasia mama khat vasak in, mualnote kikhenthamsak a, suangtumpuite neenthamsak hi — ahihang tua vui sungah Topa om ngawl hi. Vui vak thim a, tua zawkciang zinliing hi — ahihang zinliing na sungah Topa om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zinliin zawkciang meikuang khat om a, — ahihang tua meikuang sungah Topa om ngawl hi. Tua meikuang sia zawkciangin kihuauna awneal no khat za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Elijah in tua a zaak ciang a maitang a puantual taw sealin pusuak a suanghawngkua mai ah ding hi. Aw khat in ama tungah, “Elijah, hi sungah bang hi ni ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in, “ Topa Pathian Vaanglianbelpa nangma ii na — nangma bekma ii na hong sepsak tawntung khi hi. Ahihang Israel mite in nang taw a thuciamna paltan in, na biaknataute baltham a, na kamsaangte thatlum siat hi, Keima bekma taanglai khi hi — tuaciang amate in kei hong that nuam in hanciam hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa in ama munah, “Damascus naina duisung ah heak kik ta'n a, khuapi sungah tumin, Hazael sia Syria kumpipa tu in sathau noai ta'n;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nimshi ii tapa Jehu sia Israel kumpipa tu in sathau noai ta'n, tuaciang Abel Meholah pan a, Shaphat ii tapa Elisha sia nang hong laih kamsaang tu in sathau noai ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hazael ii thalup natu pan a suakta a om le Jehu in thatlum tu a, Jehu ii thalup tu pan a suakta a om le Elisha in thatlum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahihang Israel ngam ah a nungta in mihing tulsali khe lai tu khi hi — tuate sia kei tungah hong thumaan theampo le Baal mai ah a kun ngawl, a milim a namh ngawlte ahi uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Elijah in tua mun nusia in a pai le Elisha sia khui kap taw lotho in a om mu hi; ama mai ah kap sawm le kap khat om a ama sia a khakbel kap sia taw lotho hi. Elijah in a puantual suut a Elisha silhsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Elisha in a khuitalte nusia in Elijah del a, “Ka pa le ka nu ka vaithakna in va namh phot tong, tua zawkciang nangma taw tonkhawm tu khi hi,” ci hi. Elijah in, “Pha hi, cia kik ta'n. Hong khaam ngawl khi hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Elisha sia ama ii khuikaapte ngoin, a khui hakkolte mei thuna thingin zangh in a sa huan hi. Ama in a sa sia mipite hawmsak a, ne uh hi. Tua zawkciang ama in Elijah ii hupa in a nungzui hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Syria kumpipa Benhadad in a ngalkap theampo khawm a, ngam uk 32 te ii huna siphu le siphu ngalleang te taw kuanto in Samaria khuapi uumci in sim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in khuapi sungah kamtaite paisak in Israel kumpipa Ahab munah, “Kumpipa Benhadad in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ama tungah na ngunn, na khamh, na numeite le na tate a hatbel teng taw na lut tu hong tangkal hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahab in “Kumpipa Benhadad ka topa munah ka lungkimna thu son tavun; ama in kei le ka neisa theampo tang thei hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A zawkciang kamtaite in, Benhadad tung pan ngetna dang khat taw Ahab kungah hong heak kik uh hi. “Na ngunn, na khamh, na numeite le na tate nong aap natu kam hong thaak khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahizong tu in, ka uliante kong paisak tu a, na kumpi inn le na uliante ii innte tok in, manpha a sak theampo la tu hi. Amate zing ciang tubang hun khawngin hong theng tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kumpipa Ahab in ngamsung a lampui theampo samin, “Na mu uh hi a, hisia pa in ei hong susia nuam hi. Ama in kam hong thaak a, ka zite ka tate le ka ngunn ka khamh teng hong ngen hi, tuaciang kei lungkim khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lampuite le mipite in, “Ama bangma awlmaw heak in; lut heak in!” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahikom Ahab in Benhadad ii kamtaite munah, “Hong nget masak teng thukim khi hi, ahihang a niina sia thukim zo ngawl khi hi, ka topa kumpipa munah va ci tavun,” ci in zo kik hi. Kamtaite va pai a, tua zawkciang hong heak kikin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Benhadad tung pan kamthaak dang khat hong keng hi: “Na khuapi hisia a susia zo tu le amate khut tek taw suangbek teng a vawk siat zo tu mihing a khom kong paipui tu hi. Tuabangin ka ngamta bua ta le pathiante in hong vaatlum tahen!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kumpipa Ahab in, “Kumpipa Benhadad munah son tavun a, ngalkap citak khat in ngal kido zawkciang kisuangtaak pheang a, kido ma in kisuangtaak ngawl hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Benhadad in Ahab ii zona kam sia ama le a kipawlpui ngamuk dangte taw a puanbukte sungah zu a neak laitakin kison hi. Ama in a mite, khuapi sim tu kinging in sawl a, tua ahikom amate sia dinmun la tu in kuan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua laitakin kamsaang khat Kumpipa Ahab kungah hong pai a, “ Topa in, ‘Tua ngalkap hon lian sia kiita heak hen! Tuni in tuasia nangma in kong zosak tu hi, tuasia ciang keima Topa ka hi hunlam nong he tu hi,’ ” ci in son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahab in, “Akua in kidona lampui tu ziam?” ci in dongh hi. Ngamkhen uk mangte ii nuai ah a seam khangmoi ngalkapte in lampui tu hi “ Topa in ci hi,” ci in kamsaangpa in zo hi. Kumpipa in, “Ngalkaphonpi sia akua in uk tu ziam?” ci in dongh hi. “Nangma,” ci in kamsaangpa in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahikom kumpipa in ngamkhen uk mangte ii nuai a ngalkap khangmoi te sam a, a vekpi sia 232 pha hi. Tua zawkciang ama in Israel ngalkaphonpi sam a, a vekpi in 7,000 pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kisimna sia sun laitakin kipan a Benhadad le a pawlpui 32 te a puanbukte sungah zu khamin a om laitak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ngalkap khangmoite kuan masa uh hi. Benhadad ii paisak ngalvilte in Samaria pan ngalkap pawlkhat hong pai hi ci in ama tungah ko uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in thupia a, “Hong sim tu in hong kuan ahizong, kilemna ngen nuam in hong pai ahizong, amate a nungta in pummat siat vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ngalkap khangmoite in kisimna lampui in, Israel ngalkaphonpi in zuisak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />tuaciang mi simin ama ii kido pui tek that hi. Syria te tai in, Israel te in del ngawp paih ahihang Benhadad sia siphu tung to in tai a suakta hi, ama sia siphu ngalkap pawlkhat in tonpui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kumpipa Ahab sia ngalphual ah hong kuan a, siphute le siphu ngalleang te manin, Syria te in nasia takin lel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua zawkciang kamsaangpa zongh kumpipa Ahab kungah pai a, “Cia kik in a, na ngalkapte puuapha in, tuaciang a pha takin ngealkhol in, banghang ziam cile Syria kumpipa in mai khaal kipat ciang hong sim kik tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kumpipa Benhadad ii uliante in, “Israel ii pathiante sia mualpi pathiante hi a, tua hu in Israel te in ei hong zo hi. Ahizong, zaangtam ah simin hi leang zo nanak tu hi hing ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tu in ngamukmang sawmthum le nii te tawpsak in a, ngal a sim ngalkap maangte taw theak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaciang nang hong taisan sa ngalkapte za in a tam ngalkaphonpi sam in, siphute le siphu ngalleangte zongh tua za ma sam in. Israel te zaangtamna ah ih sim tu a, tu sia ciangin amate ih zo tu hi,” ci hi Kumpipa Benhadad in amate ii ngaisut piakna sia thukim a, tuabangin ngamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Khaal kipat hun hong thet kik ciangin ama in ngalkapte sam a, Aphek khuapi ah Israel te sim tu in kuan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Israel te sia kisam a, ngalvanh a cing in a kinguan sa hi; amate a kuan ciang pawl nii in kikhen a. Syria te taw kimaingat in ngiaphual saat uh hi. Israel ngalkapte sia Syria te ngamsung theampo ah a kizel te taw teengat ciang keal hon tawmno nii bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kamsaang khat Kumpipa Ahab kungah hong pai a, “ Topa in hi bangin ci hi: ‘Syria te in kei sia mualte pathian khat hi a, zaangtam te ii pathian hi ngawl hi hong ci hu in, hi ngalkap hon lian sia kong zosak tu a, tuasia ciang nang le na mite in keima Topa ka hi hunlam nong he tu uh hi, ci hi,’ ” ci in son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ni sali sung Syria te le Israel te sia kimaitua in a ngiaphual tek ah om uh hi. A ni sali ni ciang amate a kido kipan a, Israel te in Syria te tul zakhat thatlum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A suakta lai teng sia Aphek khuapi sungah tai a, a khuapi luphung cimh in, tua 27,000 te tung san ah taak suk hi. Benhadad zongh khuapi sungah suakta a, inn nung inndoi khat sungah om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Uliante ama kungah pai in, “Israel kumpipate sia ngual hesuak thei hi ci in za khu hi, Koma kawng ah khau-ip puan teangin ka ngawng uh ah khauhual te aw in, Israel kumpipa kungah ko hong paisak ta'n, tua hi le ama in na nuntakna hong khoaikhe tha tu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua ahikom amate in a kawngah khau-ip puan teang uh a, a ngawng ah khauhualte vial in Ahab kungah, “Na naseampa Benhadad in a nungta in a suatak natu hong maangkaa hi,” ci uh hi. Ahab in, “Ama nungta lai ziam? Pha hi! ama sia ka suapui khat bangma hi!” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Benhadad ii uliante in limpha khat ngaingam in a om laitak Ahab in “suapuipa” a ci poma ciang, amate in thakhatin zawp in, “Na ci bangma in Benhadad sia na suapui pa hi!” ci uh hi. “Ama keima kungah hong paipui tavun,” ci in Ahab in thupia hi. Benhadad hong thet ciang Ahab in siphu ngalleang sungah a tokhawm tu in sam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Benhadad in ama munah, “Ka pa ii na pa tung pan khua a laak teng hong pia kik tu khi hi, tuaciang Damascus khua ah nangma atu sumzuak sum leina phual khat zongh ka pa ii Samaria ah a koi bangin koi thei tu ni hi,” ci hi. Ahab in, “Hi thukimna tungtawnin nang hong suatak tu khi hi,” ci in zo kik hi. Ama in kiciamna khat vawtin, Benhadad paisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Topa ii sawlna bangin kamsaang pawlkhat sung pan khat in a kamsaang pui khat mun ma ah, ama vua in sawl hi. Ahihang tua pa in nial hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />tua ahikom ama in tua pa tungah, “ Topa ii thupiakna nial na hikom kei nong nusiat po ciang tawpi khat in nang hong thatlum tu hi,” ci hi. Tuaciangin a nusiat po ciang tawpi khat in zui paih a, ama that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tua zawkciang tua kamsaangpa ma in a dang khat ii munah, “Hong vua ta'n!” ci hi. Hi sia pa in vua hi; ama in nasia takin vua a liamsua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A kimealseal natu in kamsaangpa in a maitang puan taw tuamin pai a, lampi hui ah Israel kumpipa hong kaantan tu ngakin ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Kumpipa hong kaantan ciang kamsaang pa in biakpui a, “Kumpipa awng, ngal ka do laitakin ngalkap khat in a ngal mat khat kei kungah hong paipui a, ‘Hi sia pa cing in; a suakta napo le na nuntakna taw lul tu ni hi, tua ahibuale zong ngunntang tulthum liau tu ni hi,’ hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ahihang vai dang taw komla ka hikom tua pa suakta hi” ci hi. Kumpipa in, “Nangma le nangma thu kikhen ni hi, daan na thuak kul tu hi,’ ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Kamsaangpa in a maituamna puan eaukeak a, thakhat thu in kumpipa in kamsaang khat ahi hunlam tel paih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tuasia ciang kamsaangpa in kumpipa munah, “Hi sia Topa ii kammal hi: ‘Thalup tu in kong thupiak pa suaktasak na hikom nangma in na nuntakna taw lul tu ni hi, tuaciang ama ii ngalkaphonpi na suataksak hu in nangma ngalkaphonpi kisusia tu hi,’ ” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Kumpipa sia Samaria a inn ah cia kikin thinngim in a thin kiam hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jezreel khua sung Kumpipa Ahab ii kumpi inn hui ah Naboth a kici pasal khat ii sapithuan om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ni khat ni in Ahab in Naboth munah, “Na sapithuan kei hong pia ta'n; ka kumpi inn taw kinai a, tua leitang sia antee lamsang ciin na huan tu dei khi hi. Sapit huan a phazaw khat hong pia tu khi hi, ahibuale na deizaw le a man kilawm khat hong pia tu khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Naboth in, “Hi sapithuan sia ka taanghpupite tung pan ka luasuk hi a, Topa in nang kong piak tu hong khaam hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahab inn ah cia a, Naboth ii kampau teng hu in thin uukin a thinnuam ngawlin om hi. A lupna tungah lum a, pang sang nga in an ne nuam ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A zi Jezebel sia ama kungah pai in, “Banghangin tuaza in na thinnuam ngawl ziam? Banghang an ne ngawl tu ni ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in, “Naboth ii kei tungah hong ci teng hang hi. A sapithuan lei tu in ka paupui a, a uuk le zong huan dang khat piak tu in ka ci hi, ahihang ama in tua huan sia na neisa suak thei ngawl tu hong ci hi!” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jezebel in, “Tua le, nang kumpipa ni ziam maw hi ngawl ni ziam? Na lupna pan tho in, na maitaisakin a, an ne in. Naboth ii sapithuan keima hong ngasak tu khi hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama in laithak pawlkhat at in, Ahab min bul a, tazeik tuum in, Jezreel khua a uliante le lampuite thaak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A laithakte sungah: “An tan ni khat taangko vun, mipite sam vun, tuaciang Naboth sia upat vawt vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mihing pha ngawl nii in a maitang panin Pathian le kumpipa a haamsiatna huvau mawsuansak vun. Tua zawkciang khuapi puasia ah paipui in suangtum taw deanglum vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jezreel khua uliante le khua mi lampuite in Jezebel ii thupiak bangin ngamta uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate in antan ni khat taangko in mipi sam a, Naboth sia upat vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Misia te nii in ama sia mipi mai ah Pathian le kumpipa haamsiat hi ci in mawsuanh hi, tua ahikom ama sia khuapi puasia ah kipaipui in suangtum taw kideanglum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jezebel tungah kam kithaak a: “Naboth kithatlum zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jezebel in kam kithaak sia a nga po ciang, Ahab munah, “Naboth sia thi zo hi. Tu in a sapithuan nang hong zuak nop ngawl sia la in tang in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thakhatin Ahab pai in sapithuan sia a neisa tu in la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa in Tishbe panin kamsaangpa Elijah munah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Samaria ah Kumpipa Ahab kungah va pai ta'n. Ama sia Naboth ii sapithuan sungah tua huan sia a neisa sua tu in kithoai na mu tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama munah son in, keima Topa in ama munah, ‘Pasalpa na suamlup zawkciang a neisa la tu in kithoai lalai ni ziam,’ ci khi hi. Ama tungah hi teng son in: ‘Naboth ii chisan uite ii a lia na mun ma ah nangma chisan zongh tua uite in liak tu hi!’ ci in son ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahab in Elijah a mu ciang, “Ka ngal pa awng, kei hong pha zo ngawngaw ni ziam?” ci hi. Elijah in “Hi hi, hong pha zo khi hi,” ci in zo hi. “ Topa muna ah khialna hi teng na vawt natu in nangma le nangma kipumpiak ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ahikom Topa in, ‘Tuasiatna nang tungah kong piangsak tu hi. Nangma le na innkuan sungah pa a minpiang a haam a moi theampo kong heam siat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na bangkua sia Nebat ii tapa Kumpipa Jeroboam bangkua bang hi tu a, Ahijah ii tapa Kumpipa Baasha ii bangkua bang hi tu hi, banghang ziam cile nangma in ka thin uuk natu in nong sau a, Israel te sia mawna sungah lam na pui hi,’ hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa in Jezebel taw kisai in, a luang Jezreel khuapi sungah ui in ne tu hi, ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na mealheakte khuapi sungah a thite ui in ne tu a, ngam taanzauna munah a thite vaciik in ne tu hi,” ci hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />( Topa muna ah Ahab bangin khialna vawt natu a kipumpiak kuama dang om ngawl hi — tua theampo a zi Jezebel ii hanthotna panin piang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Israel mite maisang a nawk lai in ngamsung pan Topa ii nawkeak Amor te ii biak bangma in ama in milim biakna taw maizumhuaibel mawnate vawt hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Elijah ii a pau tu teng a man ciang Ahab in a puansilh lai te baltham in, suut a, khau-ip puan silh hi. Ama in an ne ngawlin khau-ippuan te taw lum a, mainuu in thin lalin vavak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Topa in kamsaangpa Elijah munah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Ahab in keima mai ah bangzata kiniamkhiak in a om sia na mu ziam? Hi bangin ngamta ahiciang ama khan sungah tuasiatna piangsak ngawl tu khi hi; a tapa ii khan sung in Ahab bangkua sungah tuasiatna piangsak tu khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel te le Syria te kilaklaw ah tua zawk kum nii sung ngal kilemna om hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ahihang a kum thumna ciang Judah kumpipa Jehoshaphat in Israel kumpipa Ahab taw kisi tu in hong pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahab in a uliante munah, “Banghangin Syria kumpipa tung pan Gilead ngam Ramoth khua laak kik natu bangma seam ngawl hi ziam? Tuasia eima neisa hi!” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaciang Ahab in Jehoshaphat munah, “Ramoth sim tu in kei taw nong paikhawm tu ziam?” ci in dongh hi. Jehoshaphat in, “Nangma ii kingin hunin, kei zongh kinging sa in om khi hi,” ci in zo hi, “Ka ngalkapte le ka siphu ngalkapte zongh tuabang ma hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />ahizong Topa dongh phot tawng,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahikom Ahab in kamsaangte 400 bang samin, “Kei pai in Ramoth sim tu khi ziam maw, sim ngawl tu khi ziam?” ci in dongh hi. Amate in, “Sim in, Topa in zawna hong pia tu hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahihang Jehoshaphat in, “ Topa ih dok thei natu in kamsaang dang om nawn ngawl ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahab in, “Khat om lai hi, Imlah ii tapa Micaiah hi. Ahihang ama ensan khi hi, banghang ziam cile ama in kei atu a pha bangma sonkhol ngeingawl hi; a pha ngawl khat veu hi tawntung hi,” ci in zo hi. Jehoshaphat in “Tuabangin ci heak in!” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuasia ciang, Ahab in zum uliante khat sam a, Micaiah thakhatin hong paipui ta'n, ci in sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kumpipate nii sia kumpi puantualte silh a, Samaria kongpi pua sang ancilna ah kumpi tokhumte tungah a to laitakin, kamsaang theampo in amate mai ah thusuakte son uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate sung pan khat, Chenaanah ii tapa Zedekiah in thik kiite vawt a, Ahab munah, “Hisia Topa ii pauna hi: ‘Hite taw Syria te na sim tu a, na zocip tu hi,’ ” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kamsaang dang theampo in tuabang vive ma in ci uh hi. “Ramoth a sim tu kuan tavun, zo tu nu hi,” ci uh hi. “ Topa in zawna hong pia tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua laitakin Micaiah sam tu in a pai ulian pa in, “Kamsaang dangte theampo in kumpipa zawna tu bebek son zo hi, nang zongh tuabang ma son hamtang lete pha tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahihang Micaiah in, “A nungta Topa min lo in kamciam ka piakna pan ama ii son a hong sawl teng son tu khi hi!” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama Kumpipa Ahab mai ah hong kipaipui ciang, kumpipa in, “Micaiah awng, Kumpipa Jehoshaphat le kei Ramoth ah kuanin sim tu khu ziam maw, sim ngawl tu khu ziam?” ci in dongh hi. Micaiah in, “Sim vun! Noma zo tu nu hi. Topa in zawna hong pia tu hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahihang Ahab in, “ Topa min taw kei tungah nong pau ciangin thumaan thutak son in! Bang tanvei tuabangin hong ci tu khi ziam?” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Micaiah in, “Israel ngalkapte sia mualtung tengah tuu cing pa om ngawl a tuute kithezau bangin ka mu hi. Tuaciang Topa in, ‘Hi mite in lampui nei ngawl hi; inn ah thinnuam takin cia hen,’ ” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahab in Jehoshaphat munah, “Ama in kei huvau peuma a pha khat zongh hong sonkholsak ngeingawl hi, kong ci sa hi ka na ngawl ziam; a sia khat veu hi tawntung hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Micaiah in zomto a, “Tu in Topa pauna teng ngai vun! Topa sia vantung a kumpi tokhum tungah to a, ama ii vantunglalangte a kiim ah a ding ka mu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa in, ‘Ramoth ah Ahab pai in a kithalup natu in akua in ama theam tu nu ziam?’ ci in dongh hi. Vantunglalang pawlkhat in son khat nei a, a dangte in thudang khat a son uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />a khakbelin thaa khat sia mai ah hong pai a, Topa kung zuanin, ‘Keima in ama theam tu khi hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa in ‘Bangbangin maw?’ ci in dongh hi. Tua thaa in, ‘Keima pai in Ahab ii kamsaangte theampo leilot thu ka sonsak tu hi!’ ci in zo kik hi. Topa in, ‘Va pai ta'n a, va theam ta'n, theam zo tu ni hi,’ ” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaciang Micaiah in thu khup a, “A piang thu in hisia hi. Topa in na kamsaang hite nang tungah leilot thu hong sonsak hi. Ahihang ama mama in nang tuasiatna nga tu in a thutan sa hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaciangin kamsaangpa Zedekiah in Micaiah kungah paito in, a maitang beang hi, tuaciang, “Bang hun pan kipan Topa thaa in kei hong nusia a, nang tungah hong pau ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Micaiah in, “Inn nungsang inndoi sung khat ah a buu tu in na pai ciangin mu tu ni hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Kumpipa Ahab in a uliante khat munah, “Micaiah man in a, khuapi ukpa Amon le Kumpipa tapa Joash tungah paipui vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amate in ama thong sungah koi hen a, bangma tat ngawlin kong heak kik dong anluum le tui bek taw na vaak hen, ci in son in,” ci in thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Bangma tat ngawlin nong heak kik le Topa in kei tungtawn a hong pau ngawl hi tu hi,” ci in Micaiah in ci ngaw hi. Tuaciang ama in, “Ka ci sa teng kuama po in hong ngai tavun!” ci lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Israel kumpipa Ahab le Judah kumpipa Jehoshaphat te in Gilead ah Ramoth khuapi sim tu in pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahab in Jehoshaphat munah, “Ngal kisim ciangin kei kong kimealseal tu a, nang na hile kumpi puan teng ma nong silh tu hi,” ci hi. Tuabangin Israel kumpipa kidona phual ah kimealseal in pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Syria kumpipa in a siphu ngalleang uk 32 te munah, Israel kumpipa ngawlpo a dang khat zong sim ngawl tu nu hi ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua ahikom amate in Kumpipa Jehoshaphat a mu uh ciangin a vekpi ma in Israel kumpipa sa ahiciang ama sim tu in kiheak uh hi. Ahihang ama hong au keak ciangin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />ama sia Israel kumpipa ahi ngawl hunlam phawk uh hi, tuaciang amate in sim nawn ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ahizong Syria ngalkapte khat ii kap thaltang khat in Kumpipa Ahab ii thikpuan kipeena pan kha luilam hi, “Kei liam khi hi! Ngalphual panin kiheam in!” ci in a siphu ngalleang hawlpa oksan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A kido saan lai tengin Kumpipa Ahab sia a siphu ngalleang sungah kikhuangkho in to a, Syria te maingat hi. A liamna ma pan chi luang in siphu ngalleang nuai tawdap teng tuam a, a nitak sang ciangin ama thi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Nitum kuan ciangin Israel ngalkapte a lian a no tungah thupiakna hong pai a: “Mi simin a ngam le a khuapi tek ah cia hen!,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuabangin Kumpipa Ahab thi hi. A luang Samaria ah kiciapui a, kiphum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Topa ii piang tu hi a ci bangma in, a siphu ngalleang sia Samaria tuili no ah kisil a, tua munah a chi ui in liak a, pumpi kizuak numeite kisil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Saiha taw a zep a kumpi inn le ama ii a sak khuapite thu a kihel Kumpipa Ahab ii a sep a vawt dangte theampo sia Israel Kumpipate Taanghthu sungah kikhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ama ii thi ciangin a tapa Ahazia in a kumpi za laih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Israel kumpipa Ahab ii maan zawk a kum lina ciang, Asa ii tapa Jehoshaphat sia Judah kumpipa suak hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />ama kum 35 pha a, Jerusalem panin kum 25 sung uk hi. A nu sia Azubah hi a, Shilhi ii tanu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ama mai ah a pa Asa bangma in ama in Topa muna ah a maanin ngamta hi; ahihang doai biakna munte sia kisusia ngawl a, mipite in tua munah sangaw biakpiaknate le ngimnamtui halna in zangh suak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Jehoshaphat in Israel kumpipa taw kilemna vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Jehoshaphat ii a sep a vawt na dangte theampo, a hanna, a ngal donate theampo Judah Kumpipate ii Taanghthu sungah kikhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Ama in doai biate ii biaknataute ah a pa Asa hun panin a taanglai numei ahizong, pasal ahizong pumpizuakte heam siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Edom ngam in kumpi nei ngawl a; Judah kumpipa ii koi a khutdawn khat in uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Kumpipa Jehoshaphat in Ophir ngam pan khamh pua in a pai natu tuipi teambawte vawt hi; ahihang tua teambawte Eziongeber ah lal a, tuipi sungah hong pai ngeingawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Israel kumpipa Ahaziah in ama mite le Jehoshaphat ii mite tuipi sungah khualhaw khawm tu in paisak hi, ahihang Jehoshaphat in saang ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Jehoshaphat thi a, David Khuapi sung kumpite thaan ah kiphum hi, tuaciang a tapa Jehoram in a kumpi za laih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Jehoshaphat ii maan zawk kum sawm le kum sali kumin Ahab ii tapa Ahaziah sia Israel kumpi suak hi, tuaciang ama in Samaria panin kum nii sung uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Israel te sia mawna sungah a then, a pa Ahab ii seksol ngamtatna bang le, a nu Jezebel le Kumpipa Jeroboam bangma in ama in Topa tungah maw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Ama in a mai a, a pa bangma in Baal bia in, a na sepsak hi, ama in Israel ii Pathian Topa a thin uuksak hi.
  </para>
</usx>
